1
00:02:05,883 --> 00:02:15,743
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:03:25,726 --> 00:03:30,165
Are our alps in the arena ready? We
shouldn't let them feel even our shadows.

3
00:03:30,286 --> 00:03:33,245
They are ready. Everything
is set as you ordered.

4
00:03:33,446 --> 00:03:35,165
They're waiting for us.

5
00:03:36,206 --> 00:03:39,685
It's time to ruin the enemy's plans, huh?

6
00:03:39,806 --> 00:03:40,765
Yes.

7
00:04:05,046 --> 00:04:07,205
-Boran.
-My Bey.

8
00:04:08,966 --> 00:04:12,725
-You stay here.
-As my Bey orders.

9
00:04:33,406 --> 00:04:35,285
Where does this way lead to?

10
00:04:35,646 --> 00:04:37,445
To The Red Apple?

11
00:04:37,686 --> 00:04:39,445
What is the destination?

12
00:04:39,526 --> 00:04:41,405
Martyrdom!

13
00:04:41,526 --> 00:04:43,765
What will you reach?

14
00:04:43,846 --> 00:04:45,525
Homeland!

15
00:04:45,526 --> 00:04:47,525
Where is the homeland?

16
00:04:48,126 --> 00:04:50,685
The whole world!

17
00:04:50,806 --> 00:04:52,685
May the world be your homeland!

18
00:04:52,806 --> 00:04:55,045
May the universe be your companion!

19
00:04:55,126 --> 00:04:57,125
May your cause be blessed!

20
00:04:57,526 --> 00:04:59,285
Welcome, Osman Bey.

21
00:04:59,966 --> 00:05:01,765
Thank you.

22
00:06:02,726 --> 00:06:07,165
Well, well... The emperor must be scared.

23
00:06:08,406 --> 00:06:09,765
Look.

24
00:06:10,326 --> 00:06:13,005
He's built a wall of flesh everywhere.

25
00:06:13,446 --> 00:06:16,045
We'll just watch for now.

26
00:06:18,166 --> 00:06:20,485
We're waiting for the princess to come.

27
00:06:32,086 --> 00:06:33,365
Well...

28
00:06:33,966 --> 00:06:36,365
People are expecting her.

29
00:06:36,366 --> 00:06:38,405
No news from the princess?

30
00:06:39,406 --> 00:06:42,405
There may be something up.

31
00:06:43,966 --> 00:06:46,445
Soldiers are standing on alert.

32
00:06:46,446 --> 00:06:49,445
They'd take action if there
were something wrong.

33
00:07:05,646 --> 00:07:08,045
Even Mongolians are just coming.

34
00:07:08,126 --> 00:07:10,405
Princess is going to arrive shortly.

35
00:07:10,406 --> 00:07:13,165
But we should be cautious, anyway.

36
00:07:30,326 --> 00:07:33,925
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

37
00:07:40,126 --> 00:07:43,125
The enemy was a fire around us.

38
00:07:44,046 --> 00:07:46,805
And we were woods in the middle.

39
00:07:47,726 --> 00:07:49,765
So we sat.

40
00:07:50,726 --> 00:07:53,405
Let the enemy be the fire.

41
00:07:53,606 --> 00:07:56,725
Let us be the woods in the middle.

42
00:07:57,966 --> 00:08:00,645
As long as the sky doesn't collapse...

43
00:08:01,486 --> 00:08:04,405
...and the solid ground isn't pierced

44
00:08:06,326 --> 00:08:11,685
...who can break the land
and the morals of Turks?

45
00:08:11,846 --> 00:08:14,765
-You're right my Bey.
-You're right.

46
00:08:16,326 --> 00:08:17,525
Thank you.

47
00:08:18,646 --> 00:08:20,525
Sit down, Osman Bey.

48
00:08:28,086 --> 00:08:31,045
Are your alps on duty?

49
00:08:31,126 --> 00:08:34,645
As you ordered, I sent my alps...

50
00:08:34,806 --> 00:08:37,804
...after Princess Maria to Constantinople.

51
00:08:37,926 --> 00:08:41,044
When are they going to take action?

52
00:08:41,606 --> 00:08:47,125
It's very hard to make a move in Constantinople.

53
00:08:47,766 --> 00:08:52,645
If we wait for it until Konya,

54
00:08:53,006 --> 00:08:57,365
..it will be too late. For this reason,

55
00:08:59,006 --> 00:09:01,325
...I want to take the princess on the way.

56
00:09:01,326 --> 00:09:04,685
Well thought, Osman Bey.

57
00:09:04,766 --> 00:09:08,405
Mongolians should never have the princess!

58
00:09:08,486 --> 00:09:13,085
Okay, okay. What if...

59
00:09:13,806 --> 00:09:19,565
If we fail to take the princess
and the enemy have her,

60
00:09:20,486 --> 00:09:22,285
...what will happen then?

61
00:09:22,326 --> 00:09:26,205
Then may Allah help us.

62
00:09:29,046 --> 00:09:35,925
We all had a sigh of relief when
the Ilkhanid State chose Islam.

63
00:09:36,246 --> 00:09:40,525
But even before we could breathe out,

64
00:09:41,046 --> 00:09:44,005
...they tried to choke us.

65
00:09:44,926 --> 00:09:49,845
Byzantine and Mongolians are
having an alliance with this marriage.

66
00:09:50,246 --> 00:09:54,845
-Their only purpose...
-Will be to destroy us.

67
00:09:56,646 --> 00:10:00,765
Then we won't fail.

68
00:10:03,726 --> 00:10:10,965
Well... To make such an alliance
who is the princess marrying?

69
00:10:11,006 --> 00:10:12,805
That's the matter, Osman Bey.

70
00:10:12,886 --> 00:10:17,845
Emir Coban's nephew who he
appreciates like his own son. Gorklu Khan.

71
00:10:18,006 --> 00:10:20,285
Gorklu Khan, huh?

72
00:10:23,926 --> 00:10:26,045
Gorklu Khan...

73
00:10:26,166 --> 00:10:30,605
He himself is coming to
Konya to take the princess.

74
00:10:30,966 --> 00:10:33,365
Alright.

75
00:10:33,846 --> 00:10:38,645
Don't be worrying. We will
be victorious with Allah's will.

76
00:10:40,046 --> 00:10:41,085
Then..

77
00:10:44,686 --> 00:10:48,285
I need to go back to my duty. Excuse me now.

78
00:10:48,406 --> 00:10:50,525
Sit down.

79
00:10:50,566 --> 00:10:58,085
We didn't invite you to give you information
Osman Bey. We use messengers for that.

80
00:10:59,286 --> 00:11:04,325
We have a more important matter.

81
00:11:42,526 --> 00:11:46,725
People of Rome! Your waiting is ending soon!

82
00:11:47,046 --> 00:11:50,565
Our magnificent princess Maria will salute you!

83
00:12:18,326 --> 00:12:25,445
Well, well... Here comes the princess.

84
00:12:36,126 --> 00:12:41,645
-Long live the princess!
-Princess Maria!

85
00:12:53,446 --> 00:12:58,605
Long live Princess Maria!

86
00:13:02,086 --> 00:13:08,565
My dear people! You've come
from all the way around Byzantine!

87
00:13:08,766 --> 00:13:12,405
-I salute you!
-Long live!

88
00:13:15,606 --> 00:13:19,445
May Jesus Christ be with you!

89
00:13:23,166 --> 00:13:29,965
Come on! Let the feast continue!

90
00:14:40,686 --> 00:14:43,405
If this wedding is done..

91
00:14:43,486 --> 00:14:46,805
Byzantine would be a great trouble to us.

92
00:14:46,886 --> 00:14:50,405
We need to stop it one way or another.

93
00:14:57,246 --> 00:15:00,765
Let us infiltrate them, my bey.

94
00:15:01,286 --> 00:15:05,605
It will be like that. Good job, my valiant.

95
00:15:05,846 --> 00:15:10,885
First let the caravan of princess
be prepared, then you have the duty.

96
00:15:11,046 --> 00:15:15,045
As you command, my bey.

97
00:15:26,646 --> 00:15:29,805
Can you tell me about Tabriz, Mongol?

98
00:15:29,886 --> 00:15:34,085
Are people there harsh like you?

99
00:15:35,286 --> 00:15:38,365
The only thing that keeps
Mongols alive, in the deadly..

100
00:15:38,446 --> 00:15:42,165
Cold of steppes is war, princess.

101
00:15:42,406 --> 00:15:48,005
That is why every Mongol is harsh and a warrior.

102
00:15:48,926 --> 00:15:52,245
I guessed as much.

103
00:15:53,806 --> 00:15:59,645
That is why these showmen
will come with me for my wedding.

104
00:16:02,246 --> 00:16:09,485
If I can not stay at Constantinople,
I will take its magnificence with me.

105
00:16:10,526 --> 00:16:16,965
You will be a bride to Amir Choban, Princess.
This is a dream of many hatuns of tribe.

106
00:16:17,166 --> 00:16:22,605
You will see greater versions of these shows.

107
00:16:26,166 --> 00:16:31,005
I know. However, the real show..

108
00:16:31,126 --> 00:16:38,405
Will begin when we expel
Turks from our lands forever.

109
00:16:59,686 --> 00:17:05,964
We've been watching you
for all these years, Osman Bey.

110
00:17:06,126 --> 00:17:11,444
You did not do wrong, stained
your honor or fell for tricks..

111
00:17:11,526 --> 00:17:16,365
You answered truthfully to everything.

112
00:17:16,444 --> 00:17:19,964
Thank Allah, thank Allah, thank Allah.

113
00:17:20,046 --> 00:17:25,045
However, we still waited. This
valiant called "Osman Bey"..

114
00:17:25,126 --> 00:17:30,285
Is after his own gain or the order of the world.

115
00:17:30,366 --> 00:17:33,405
We wanted to see for the last time.

116
00:17:53,286 --> 00:17:59,085
We saw and believed. We came to a decision.

117
00:17:59,246 --> 00:18:05,685
Build your sovereign Beylic now, Osman Bey.

118
00:18:11,326 --> 00:18:14,885
Praise be!

119
00:18:16,486 --> 00:18:20,205
Praise be!

120
00:18:31,726 --> 00:18:35,285
Thank Glorious Allah..

121
00:18:35,846 --> 00:18:39,605
Who does not hold us responsible with victory..

122
00:18:39,766 --> 00:18:43,405
But with the road itself.

123
00:18:45,446 --> 00:18:48,805
Nobles of my land..

124
00:18:49,086 --> 00:18:53,325
Have seen me fit for this big duty.

125
00:18:54,486 --> 00:18:56,245
May you live long.

126
00:18:58,246 --> 00:19:05,365
May Allah be my witness;
My country and my people..

127
00:19:05,526 --> 00:19:09,725
Will always remain free.

128
00:19:12,086 --> 00:19:17,965
What about other beylics? Candar..

129
00:19:18,166 --> 00:19:22,325
Karasids, Hamidids.

130
00:19:23,046 --> 00:19:29,485
They used to follow
Germiyanids. What will they say?

131
00:19:29,566 --> 00:19:36,485
Do you know how Yakup Bey
made beys follow him, Osman Bey?

132
00:19:36,926 --> 00:19:41,725
By putting daggers to each of their privacy.

133
00:19:42,246 --> 00:19:47,325
By threatening them with their
lives and making them bow.

134
00:19:51,646 --> 00:19:54,965
Yakup Bey.

135
00:19:55,046 --> 00:19:58,645
-Yakup Bey.
-May the crooked sword..

136
00:19:58,726 --> 00:20:01,765
Rust in its sheathe.

137
00:20:02,446 --> 00:20:06,445
May you walk your path, Osman Bey.

138
00:20:06,566 --> 00:20:14,125
Thank you. It will be like
that, as you commanded.

139
00:20:14,566 --> 00:20:20,325
Now, the path is clear. Those
who will walk it also clear.

140
00:20:20,526 --> 00:20:24,725
The state that will unit Turks, is clear.

141
00:20:27,326 --> 00:20:31,965
May it be Gokturks, Seljuks.
Turks always have their country.

142
00:20:32,526 --> 00:20:36,325
Turks always have a state.

143
00:20:37,286 --> 00:20:42,405
Now, it is time to be State of Osman!

144
00:20:43,326 --> 00:20:46,405
Praise be!

145
00:20:46,606 --> 00:20:50,405
May your state be glorious, Osman Bey!

146
00:20:50,486 --> 00:20:52,525
Ameen.

147
00:20:55,286 --> 00:20:56,565
Ameen.

148
00:21:01,566 --> 00:21:02,325
Ameen.

149
00:21:20,086 --> 00:21:26,245
May Glorious Allah be my
witness I will always stand firm.

150
00:21:27,646 --> 00:21:32,445
I will build a great country..

151
00:21:32,646 --> 00:21:37,405
That will be a home to the whole world..

152
00:21:37,646 --> 00:21:41,725
And will be under the
shadow of the banner of Islam.

153
00:21:43,686 --> 00:21:50,445
Then, hear one of the secrets
of Turks' state, Osman Bey.

154
00:21:51,006 --> 00:21:54,525
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the compassionate.

155
00:21:54,926 --> 00:22:00,965
Our Allah commands in the Al-Qasas Surah..

156
00:22:02,726 --> 00:22:05,925
"That eternaT Home in the Hereafter..

157
00:22:06,046 --> 00:22:11,565
We reserve only1 for those who seek neither
tyranny nor corruption on the earth..

158
00:22:11,726 --> 00:22:16,365
The ultimate outcome belongs
only' to the righteous." [28:83]

159
00:22:16,646 --> 00:22:20,405
Allah almighty told the truth.

160
00:22:21,846 --> 00:22:27,285
-May your cause be glorious, Osman Bey.
-May your cause be glorious, Osman Bey.

161
00:22:28,966 --> 00:22:32,085
Thank you.

162
00:22:35,006 --> 00:22:37,485
Thank you.

163
00:22:41,126 --> 00:22:46,125
May you live long.
May you live long.

164
00:22:49,566 --> 00:22:55,845
For sure, our cause is holy.

165
00:23:45,446 --> 00:23:49,925
Nokers, Horseman ready the field.

166
00:23:50,046 --> 00:23:55,525
Sacrifices too. Everything will be
ready when Gorklu Khan comes.

167
00:23:55,766 --> 00:24:00,965
If anyone makes a
mistake I will take your lives.

168
00:24:02,926 --> 00:24:06,645
That is me.

169
00:24:10,526 --> 00:24:15,365
Mergen. What do you see?

170
00:24:15,806 --> 00:24:21,205
Blood, blood, blood!

171
00:24:24,926 --> 00:24:30,085
Blood you say? That blood will be Osman's blood.

172
00:24:31,486 --> 00:24:34,525
When Gorklu Khan weds the princess..

173
00:24:34,606 --> 00:24:39,165
The army of Rome will be under our
command. Turk blood will be spilled!

174
00:24:39,246 --> 00:24:41,725
Rivers of it!

175
00:24:50,446 --> 00:24:53,005
Mergen, speak.

176
00:24:53,086 --> 00:24:56,965
The grand Mongol state
will be built on Turk blood.

177
00:24:57,246 --> 00:25:00,405
That is what I see!

178
00:25:45,006 --> 00:25:49,165
Thank You, my Allah.. My Allah...

179
00:25:49,846 --> 00:25:54,485
Thank You...
Thanks to Allah...

180
00:26:06,006 --> 00:26:08,565
Boran! -My Bey!

181
00:26:12,566 --> 00:26:15,325
Now we are free!

182
00:26:15,606 --> 00:26:19,525
We will declare our independence!

183
00:26:20,006 --> 00:26:22,685
My Bey, what are you saying?

184
00:26:22,966 --> 00:26:26,645
Konya, Mongols...

185
00:26:28,246 --> 00:26:33,645
...and Yakub...It will be harder for them.

186
00:26:37,126 --> 00:26:41,445
Either we will disappear for our independence...

187
00:26:42,326 --> 00:26:47,325
..or we will establish..

188
00:26:47,726 --> 00:26:51,285
...a great state that will last forever!

189
00:26:55,046 --> 00:26:59,205
Come on. Inform Kayi's Beys.

190
00:27:00,606 --> 00:27:05,845
I want to host them all in my council.

191
00:27:06,286 --> 00:27:10,405
Only Kayi Beys, my Bey?

192
00:27:10,526 --> 00:27:16,645
From now on, we will walk
with people who are on our side...

193
00:27:16,726 --> 00:27:21,565
...not with people who we believe
to be on our side. Only Kayi's Beys.

194
00:27:24,526 --> 00:27:29,605
Come on. Go to Yenisehir.

195
00:27:29,686 --> 00:27:35,085
Send a messenger, Boran.
-My Osman Bey..

196
00:27:57,046 --> 00:28:01,565
Thanks to my Allah..
Thanks to my Allah..

197
00:28:04,086 --> 00:28:07,885
Go now. Send a messenger.

198
00:28:09,006 --> 00:28:12,125
My Bey, where will you go?

199
00:28:14,846 --> 00:28:18,245
I will go to...

200
00:28:19,566 --> 00:28:24,005
...my father Ertugrul Ghazi
to give him the good news.

201
00:28:24,206 --> 00:28:28,125
Yes my Bey. Yes my Bey.

202
00:28:35,086 --> 00:28:36,005
I
f
*5 , \'

203
00:29:26,566 --> 00:29:32,165
Princess' caravan will be
prepared! Where are the carriers?

204
00:29:39,246 --> 00:29:42,925
The trader came. Hurry. Come on.

205
00:29:43,046 --> 00:29:46,445
Konur Bey... If I didn't know about your past...

206
00:29:46,526 --> 00:29:48,885
...I would think you were a different person.

207
00:29:48,966 --> 00:29:53,085
Is that so? You don't seem
normal either, Bayindir Bey.

208
00:29:53,206 --> 00:29:54,845
Come on.

209
00:29:55,566 --> 00:30:00,325
This will be done as soon as
possible! Hurry, you stupid people!

210
00:30:01,486 --> 00:30:03,645
Where have you been you stupid men?

211
00:30:03,726 --> 00:30:09,925
I will make you pay for it if you do
not prepare the caravan on time. Hurry!

212
00:30:10,206 --> 00:30:15,805
Trader Sergio. The caravan had to be ready.

213
00:30:18,126 --> 00:30:20,565
Commander Ducas... It is ready.

214
00:30:20,646 --> 00:30:22,565
It will be ready but... -It will be done...

215
00:30:22,646 --> 00:30:25,645
...before the sun sets in Constantinople.

216
00:30:25,726 --> 00:30:28,165
Do you understand? -Yes.

217
00:30:28,326 --> 00:30:31,325
I understand, Commander Dukas.

218
00:30:31,406 --> 00:30:36,685
Hurry! Come on, you stupid men!

219
00:30:39,606 --> 00:30:44,325
Trader Sergio... Why are
we in a rush for the caravan?

220
00:30:44,526 --> 00:30:47,125
We need to do an
outstanding job for the Princess.

221
00:30:47,206 --> 00:30:49,805
My goods are already outstanding, idiot.

222
00:30:50,006 --> 00:30:54,165
Princess must set out as soon as
possible so Byzantium can get rid of Turks.

223
00:30:54,766 --> 00:30:58,285
Sure... May holy Jesus help them.

224
00:30:58,486 --> 00:31:01,645
Don't worry. We will prepare the caravan.

225
00:31:01,806 --> 00:31:04,805
Where will we bring the
caravan after it is ready?

226
00:31:05,006 --> 00:31:09,445
Have it prepared first, then you
will take it to the inn behind the arena.

227
00:31:09,526 --> 00:31:12,005
Then you will set out from there.

228
00:31:12,526 --> 00:31:18,525
Sure, if they have a route. What good can come
from the route planned at the last moment?

229
00:31:35,686 --> 00:31:41,685
Saadet Hatun calls Holofira her
"daughter-in-law" Alaeddin. Daughter in law.

230
00:31:41,806 --> 00:31:45,725
We cannot be sure before
we listen to Holofira, brother.

231
00:31:53,806 --> 00:31:58,045
Holofira will never say yes to Mehmet.

232
00:31:58,486 --> 00:32:02,565
If she doesn't become a Muslim, it
will be hard to convince Malhun mother.

233
00:32:14,246 --> 00:32:20,365
She will. She will accept
becoming a Muslim. If she does not...

234
00:32:21,726 --> 00:32:24,525
..then I will abduct her.

235
00:32:27,326 --> 00:32:32,285
Stop, brother... You
need to talk to Holofira first.

236
00:32:32,526 --> 00:32:35,765
I can go and ask Gonca Hatun
without letting her know, huh?

237
00:32:35,846 --> 00:32:38,885
So you will sound Gonca out, huh?

238
00:32:43,526 --> 00:32:48,285
Look at you... You are looking
for an excuse to talk to that Hatun.

239
00:32:48,766 --> 00:32:53,605
That Hatun is looking for a way to escape
when she sees you. How will you talk to her?

240
00:32:55,726 --> 00:32:59,125
And that is my secret, brother.

241
00:33:22,126 --> 00:33:27,125
If Holofira says yes, it will be
really hard to control Orhan.

242
00:33:27,206 --> 00:33:30,885
We must find a bride as soon as possible.

243
00:33:31,246 --> 00:33:35,685
Ulgen, you are the one who
can do this in the best way.

244
00:33:36,646 --> 00:33:40,365
The things we heard from others were not useful.

245
00:33:40,486 --> 00:33:44,445
Look around carefully, and find us a good bride.

246
00:33:44,726 --> 00:33:50,685
Don't worry. I will find good-hearted
brides for our Shahzades.

247
00:33:50,966 --> 00:33:57,405
You don't like Gonca, I see
that. But I don't know why.

248
00:33:58,486 --> 00:34:02,925
You will give me the answer of it today, Ulgen.

249
00:34:04,966 --> 00:34:08,764
Good news! Good news!

250
00:34:10,966 --> 00:34:15,645
Osman Bey is now independent!
No one can stand in his way now!

251
00:34:18,005 --> 00:34:21,925
What happened Boran Bey? May it be good.

252
00:34:28,485 --> 00:34:31,645
The elders of Turks allowed us...

253
00:34:31,726 --> 00:34:36,205
Now we are an independent Beylic, Alhamdulillah.

254
00:34:37,686 --> 00:34:39,725
Alhamdulillah.

255
00:34:39,846 --> 00:34:44,205
We are one step closer to our
blessed dream, huh? Thanks to Allah!

256
00:34:44,326 --> 00:34:48,005
Thanks to Him, He let us see these days.

257
00:34:48,085 --> 00:34:51,045
Thanks to Allah!

258
00:35:07,246 --> 00:35:11,005
Thanks to Allah!

259
00:35:16,846 --> 00:35:20,405
My Allah, I seek refuge in
You from the accursed shaitaan.

260
00:35:20,646 --> 00:35:24,885
In the name of Allah, the Most
Gracious, the Most Merciful.

261
00:35:50,766 --> 00:35:55,725
My father... My ancestor...

262
00:35:57,966 --> 00:36:00,885
My Bey...

263
00:36:05,766 --> 00:36:09,005
I have good news for you.

264
00:36:09,726 --> 00:36:13,925
I have good news for you.

265
00:36:23,206 --> 00:36:28,805
Your dreams... Our dreams..

266
00:36:29,406 --> 00:36:33,525
...have come true.

267
00:36:34,646 --> 00:36:40,525
With Allah's consent, from now on we will be...

268
00:36:41,206 --> 00:36:45,725
...a sovereign and an independent Beylic

269
00:36:46,366 --> 00:36:49,605
You fought against the cruel.

270
00:36:49,926 --> 00:36:54,965
You got over many hardships, but...

271
00:36:55,166 --> 00:36:59,765
But I followed you without losing my way.

272
00:37:04,126 --> 00:37:08,165
I know it will be harder now.

273
00:37:09,126 --> 00:37:14,725
Now, our responsibilities will be heavier.

274
00:37:15,086 --> 00:37:20,285
I know that Allah is letting
us rule and testing our justice.

275
00:37:20,446 --> 00:37:24,325
Allah is giving us power and testing our mercy.

276
00:37:24,606 --> 00:37:27,285
And...

277
00:37:28,006 --> 00:37:33,285
And the burden of the state on my shoulders...

278
00:37:33,366 --> 00:37:36,005
Father...

279
00:37:40,566 --> 00:37:45,605
I am afraid of not being able to stand it.

280
00:37:47,686 --> 00:37:53,005
Father... The people are entrusted to me now.

281
00:37:53,086 --> 00:37:56,925
Our future is entrusted to me now.

282
00:37:57,686 --> 00:38:04,845
The fortune of a nation
the history of a nation..

283
00:38:06,446 --> 00:38:10,285
...is now entrusted to me.

284
00:38:10,966 --> 00:38:16,805
There is no one we depend on,
there is no one behind us anymore.

285
00:38:19,126 --> 00:38:22,965
We are alone now.

286
00:38:23,606 --> 00:38:28,725
You taught me, father, you would say...

287
00:38:28,846 --> 00:38:35,125
..."If the burden is too
heavy to carry for you...

288
00:38:35,406 --> 00:38:38,645
...then..

289
00:38:39,446 --> 00:38:45,765
...stand up for the nation, for the
state." "When the issues grow...

290
00:38:45,846 --> 00:38:52,045
...a brave heart is always better
than a sharp sword", you would say.

291
00:38:54,806 --> 00:39:01,805
For sure, for sure we are courageous enough.

292
00:39:02,166 --> 00:39:09,765
Whether we are few or many,
the conquests will never stop.

293
00:39:10,286 --> 00:39:16,405
We will fly the sanjak of
Islam everywhere in the world.

294
00:39:18,806 --> 00:39:23,325
Alhamdulillah..
Alhamdulillah..

295
00:39:23,846 --> 00:39:30,405
Alhamdulillah... My father..

296
00:39:31,446 --> 00:39:37,165
It was entrusted from you to me...

297
00:39:37,726 --> 00:39:43,765
...and from me to my children. You
don't have to worry about it anymore.

298
00:39:44,526 --> 00:39:49,325
Ertugrul Ghazi.

299
00:40:00,286 --> 00:40:07,245
My Allah, the Owner of all
the properties. Thank you.

300
00:40:08,326 --> 00:40:14,045
You made us live these days, thank you.

301
00:40:15,126 --> 00:40:20,045
My Allah, let us serve the Islam tomorrow

302
00:40:20,206 --> 00:40:24,285
just like we did in the past and today.

303
00:40:24,446 --> 00:40:31,925
Grant us the ability to
rule with justice and mercy.

304
00:40:44,046 --> 00:40:50,685
Come on sisters, come on!
Today is a blessed day, let's hurry.

305
00:41:14,006 --> 00:41:17,885
It is great, right, mother?

306
00:41:22,046 --> 00:41:28,085
My Rabb let us see these days, thankfully.

307
00:41:33,406 --> 00:41:37,965
The majestic plane tree is taking root.

308
00:41:39,086 --> 00:41:43,325
It is flourishing before our eyes.

309
00:41:43,886 --> 00:41:47,605
And we're witnessing it.

310
00:41:49,886 --> 00:41:54,165
May Allah make us all worthy of it.

311
00:41:56,286 --> 00:41:59,405
Aameen.

312
00:42:09,406 --> 00:42:10,605
My Shahzade

313
00:42:10,686 --> 00:42:15,205
is there anything missing? If there is,
let me go to the marketplace and buy it.

314
00:42:15,366 --> 00:42:18,605
So I can see Gonca Hatun.

315
00:42:18,806 --> 00:42:21,605
No, you will help us outside.

316
00:42:21,766 --> 00:42:25,605
I said I want to see Gonca Hatun.

317
00:42:25,846 --> 00:42:30,245
But if you don't get how a lover feels.

318
00:42:31,726 --> 00:42:35,765
We do. We understand.

319
00:42:36,286 --> 00:42:40,245
We understand you the best, Ghazi Alp.

320
00:42:40,406 --> 00:42:46,765
I know you, my Shahzade, but who
is Shahzade Alaeddin in love with?

321
00:42:56,646 --> 00:43:02,485
You... You wrote that letter
to Gonca Hatun, is that so?

322
00:43:05,166 --> 00:43:10,885
Be quiet Ghazi, one should not
let everyone talk about his lover.

323
00:43:12,566 --> 00:43:18,485
We're rivals now, Alaeddin Bey!

324
00:43:20,446 --> 00:43:23,765
Keep it in your mind!

325
00:43:24,046 --> 00:43:27,285
-My Shahzade.
-Ghazi Alp.

326
00:43:38,886 --> 00:43:42,125
Look at him.

327
00:43:43,726 --> 00:43:48,685
Alaeddin, I told you. Your
biggest rival is Ghazi Alp.

328
00:43:48,766 --> 00:43:53,205
-He's not an easy rival.
-He almost drew the sword.

329
00:44:03,886 --> 00:44:08,885
They left you, I set you free.

330
00:44:09,166 --> 00:44:15,365
I expect you to serve
your state and your nation.

331
00:44:15,446 --> 00:44:21,525
Go to Yenisehir, they're waiting for you.

332
00:44:39,006 --> 00:44:43,565
Come on. Give the good news.

333
00:45:08,686 --> 00:45:12,605
You called me, Bala Hatun.

334
00:45:13,646 --> 00:45:17,405
You ran away from me in the marketplace, Ulgen.

335
00:45:18,206 --> 00:45:23,525
Now tell me what you're hiding.
What do you know about Gonca?

336
00:45:23,766 --> 00:45:29,005
-Bala Hatun, I don't know anything.
-Ulgen.

337
00:45:29,486 --> 00:45:35,085
Don't lie to me. There's
something but you're not telling me.

338
00:45:35,326 --> 00:45:38,485
Now tell me.

339
00:45:41,046 --> 00:45:48,045
Shahzade Alaeddin and
Gonca Hatun cannot be together.

340
00:45:50,886 --> 00:45:54,765
They can't, because...

341
00:45:58,366 --> 00:46:02,165
...Gonca loves somebody else.

342
00:46:04,726 --> 00:46:07,725
What are you saying, Ulgen?

343
00:46:11,806 --> 00:46:17,125
I thought Gonca was playing
tricks on us with her family.

344
00:46:21,966 --> 00:46:26,805
Are you sure about it? Did Gonca tell you?

345
00:46:27,046 --> 00:46:31,845
No. I heard it from the hatuns close to her.

346
00:46:31,966 --> 00:46:35,365
Thank you Ulgen.

347
00:46:40,126 --> 00:46:44,725
What a terrible lie I've told.

348
00:46:48,046 --> 00:46:51,045
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

349
00:46:51,446 --> 00:46:56,085
-May I come in, my Sultan?
-Come in.

350
00:46:57,526 --> 00:47:03,405
My Sultan, we have news from
Yenisehir, from Cerkutay Bey.

351
00:47:24,326 --> 00:47:27,045
Osman.

352
00:47:27,806 --> 00:47:30,485
What's going on, Yakup Bey?

353
00:47:30,606 --> 00:47:34,285
Osman. Osman.

354
00:47:34,646 --> 00:47:36,845
Father, what's going on?

355
00:47:36,926 --> 00:47:42,245
-Osman is forming his sovereign Beylic.
-What?

356
00:47:42,886 --> 00:47:47,725
He's showing his teeth.
He's challenging us.

357
00:47:48,166 --> 00:47:51,485
How could he do this without asking you, father?

358
00:47:51,566 --> 00:47:55,245
How dare Osman do this, Yakup Bey?

359
00:47:55,406 --> 00:47:59,365
Establishing his sovereign
Beylic will cause conflict.

360
00:47:59,926 --> 00:48:05,125
It will! It will cause conflict.

361
00:48:05,566 --> 00:48:11,325
If there is the slightest separation or problem,

362
00:48:11,486 --> 00:48:16,325
they will immediately go to Osman.

363
00:48:18,766 --> 00:48:24,125
But I will not let it happen.

364
00:48:25,646 --> 00:48:30,765
I will break the person who
separates, I will cut the problem.

365
00:48:31,206 --> 00:48:36,645
Who are you to become a Sultan, Osman?

366
00:48:38,486 --> 00:48:41,245
-Kanyumaz.
-My Sultan.

367
00:48:41,486 --> 00:48:45,845
Send messengers to Beys. I want
them all to come before me tonight.

368
00:48:45,926 --> 00:48:49,925
Yes, my Sultan.
-Mehmed.

369
00:48:50,206 --> 00:48:56,365
Inform the spies around Yenisehir
and tell them to keep their eyes open.

370
00:48:56,446 --> 00:49:00,805
Let us be aware of even
the flying bird. We will know

371
00:49:01,046 --> 00:49:04,725
what's Osman doing and who is with him.

372
00:49:04,806 --> 00:49:07,485
Yes, father.

373
00:49:12,366 --> 00:49:13,445
Osman

374
00:49:40,686 --> 00:49:46,325
Come here.
BismillahirRahmanirRahim.

375
00:49:50,366 --> 00:49:55,245
-My father.
-Give it to me.

376
00:50:04,806 --> 00:50:08,765
Our dream is coming true, father.

377
00:50:09,606 --> 00:50:12,965
That's right, children.

378
00:50:13,606 --> 00:50:18,885
The journey that my ancestor Suleyman Shah

379
00:50:19,126 --> 00:50:24,685
and my ancestor Ertugrul Ghazi
took from the Caspian Sea to Ahlat

380
00:50:24,766 --> 00:50:32,085
and from Ahlat to Aleppo in pursuit of a dream

381
00:50:33,806 --> 00:50:36,405
has now become real.

382
00:50:36,526 --> 00:50:42,005
-Thankfully.
-Thankfully, my Bey. Kayi is free now.

383
00:50:42,286 --> 00:50:45,605
It is free.

384
00:50:56,846 --> 00:51:00,925
It is time to take root.

385
00:51:01,486 --> 00:51:05,565
We have a long way to
go, the world is big, my Bey.

386
00:51:05,846 --> 00:51:11,365
Our roots will be here but the branches

387
00:51:11,446 --> 00:51:16,525
will spread around the world
thanks to you and your children.

388
00:51:16,646 --> 00:51:19,285
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-Let it cover the world...

389
00:51:19,366 --> 00:51:25,005
-...and shelter the innocent people, my Bey.
-We will advance as long as we breathe, my Bey.

390
00:51:25,206 --> 00:51:31,485
We will advance for sure. But the path is tough.

391
00:51:31,566 --> 00:51:35,525
It's not right to walk alone.

392
00:51:38,486 --> 00:51:41,685
Alaeddin.

393
00:51:42,966 --> 00:51:47,245
Tell me, how's your love affair going?

394
00:51:51,246 --> 00:51:55,885
Orhan, what about you?

395
00:51:59,246 --> 00:52:02,285
-My Bey.
-We'll handle it, my Bey.

396
00:52:02,486 --> 00:52:06,925
We'll handle it and we
will make the state prosper.

397
00:52:08,606 --> 00:52:12,925
-And we will take what's in our heart, I hope.
-I hope so.

398
00:52:13,246 --> 00:52:18,285
I want you to show this courage
before Holofira as well, brother.

399
00:52:27,086 --> 00:52:30,845
May I come in, my Bey?

400
00:52:31,806 --> 00:52:35,405
Come in.

401
00:52:39,046 --> 00:52:43,285
My Bey, all the beys of Kayi
are here, they're waiting for you.

402
00:52:45,446 --> 00:52:49,605
We've been waiting for
this moment for a long time.

403
00:52:50,406 --> 00:52:55,365
Welcome. Welcome.

404
00:52:58,806 --> 00:53:03,685
Do you know about the situation?

405
00:53:10,806 --> 00:53:17,165
Osman Bey has declared his sovereign Beylic.

406
00:53:20,846 --> 00:53:26,885
If you hadn't doubted and stood behind him

407
00:53:27,126 --> 00:53:31,005
and if you hadn't given him power

408
00:53:33,006 --> 00:53:39,085
he wouldn't have dared to boast and do this.

409
00:53:39,966 --> 00:53:44,685
If such a separation is taking place today

410
00:53:45,126 --> 00:53:49,365
you are all responsible for this.

411
00:53:50,646 --> 00:53:54,885
So you didn't do anything, is that so

412
00:53:56,006 --> 00:54:00,565
Sultan Yakup?

413
00:54:01,846 --> 00:54:08,925
Whatever I did, I did it for the sake
of my nation. What did Osman do?

414
00:54:09,246 --> 00:54:13,405
They survived thanks to us.

415
00:54:13,486 --> 00:54:19,165
Do you think Mongols and
Byzantium will let them live

416
00:54:19,406 --> 00:54:23,325
when they hear they have been separated?

417
00:54:24,126 --> 00:54:29,165
It will be a pity for his people.

418
00:54:35,926 --> 00:54:41,245
Now you will hear the new laws.

419
00:54:44,246 --> 00:54:49,685
Each of you will arm three thousand alps...

420
00:54:50,166 --> 00:54:53,445
...and send them to the east.

421
00:54:56,646 --> 00:55:02,005
Increase the number of
patrols. Our borders will be clear.

422
00:55:03,046 --> 00:55:05,165
Kanyumaz.

423
00:55:05,326 --> 00:55:08,205
Alps, bring the gold.

424
00:55:23,166 --> 00:55:26,525
These are the coins...

425
00:55:26,686 --> 00:55:29,965
..we've collected in the frontier market so far.

426
00:55:31,926 --> 00:55:35,485
The salaries of 3000 alps...

427
00:55:36,926 --> 00:55:39,845
...will be paid by me.

428
00:55:43,006 --> 00:55:47,285
And you will share the rest.

429
00:55:49,166 --> 00:55:55,405
As for the taxes, I've
remitted the taxes this year.

430
00:55:55,766 --> 00:55:57,605
Long live the Sultan!

431
00:55:57,686 --> 00:56:00,325
-Thank you, my Sultan!
-Long live the Sultan!

432
00:56:00,406 --> 00:56:02,165
Thank you, my Sultan.

433
00:56:02,246 --> 00:56:05,405
-Long live the Sultan!
-Beys...

434
00:56:05,686 --> 00:56:09,205
The burden of the war will be heavy.

435
00:56:09,486 --> 00:56:12,085
Send your alps to their duties.

436
00:56:12,726 --> 00:56:15,285
Arm the rest.

437
00:56:15,606 --> 00:56:21,565
We will perform raids on Byzantine as before.

438
00:56:22,486 --> 00:56:28,765
As thirsty for battle as the first
day when we stepped on this land.

439
00:56:29,046 --> 00:56:31,485
And as ambitious as the first day!

440
00:56:33,486 --> 00:56:37,525
But this time...

441
00:56:37,806 --> 00:56:40,725
...you will have Great Germiyan's support.

442
00:56:40,766 --> 00:56:43,725
-Thank you, my Sultan.
-Long live the Sultan.

443
00:56:43,766 --> 00:56:46,045
Thank you, my Sultan.

444
00:56:46,486 --> 00:56:51,405
I want only one thing in return.

445
00:57:00,966 --> 00:57:04,045
Absolute loyalty.

446
00:57:09,326 --> 00:57:12,645
We've been waiting for the day to be free.

447
00:57:12,886 --> 00:57:14,885
Thanks Allah for letting us be free.

448
00:57:14,926 --> 00:57:16,885
Amen. Amen.

449
00:57:16,966 --> 00:57:18,685
He didn't mind Yakup Bey...

450
00:57:19,086 --> 00:57:22,685
...or Mongolians. And he founded his beylic.

451
00:57:22,766 --> 00:57:27,245
Osman Bey has earned his reputation.

452
00:57:31,966 --> 00:57:35,365
We've been waiting for this for long.

453
00:57:35,446 --> 00:57:40,685
Thanks to Allah. We've reached
the dream of an independent beylic.

454
00:57:47,726 --> 00:57:51,525
Attention, Osman Bey!

455
00:57:58,446 --> 00:58:04,845
Long live Osman Bey!
Long live Osman Bey!

456
00:58:08,526 --> 00:58:13,525
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

457
00:58:14,246 --> 00:58:19,125
Well, warriors... What did you stop? Go on!

458
00:58:21,446 --> 00:58:24,405
Aykut, Baysungur.

459
00:58:25,126 --> 00:58:29,165
Hand out the gold to people.

460
00:58:35,686 --> 00:58:40,125
-Well... Here we go.
-Osman Bey.

461
00:58:40,166 --> 00:58:45,285
May Allah be pleased with you
for making us see this blessed day.

462
00:58:45,486 --> 00:58:49,245
We have gifts for our Bey if you accept.

463
00:58:50,126 --> 00:58:52,965
Thank you, thank you.

464
00:58:53,246 --> 00:58:58,685
May it protect you from the vile
looking like the good. May it be blessed!

465
00:59:00,166 --> 00:59:02,605
-Thank you.
-My Bey.

466
00:59:02,766 --> 00:59:08,245
May it take your from lands to lands like the
wind. May where its shoes step on be fertile.

467
00:59:13,006 --> 00:59:16,765
Praise be! Praise be!

468
00:59:17,086 --> 00:59:21,005
Oh... Iltutan(his horse) shouldn't hear that.

469
00:59:24,166 --> 00:59:29,565
May your sword be on the heathen's
neck all the time! May it be blessed!

470
00:59:29,646 --> 00:59:34,765
Thank you, Beys of Kayi.
Thank you.

471
00:59:40,646 --> 00:59:42,605
Alps!

472
00:59:45,206 --> 00:59:49,485
Thank you. Thank you.

473
00:59:51,246 --> 00:59:56,925
Everything will be harder than before.

474
00:59:57,646 --> 01:00:01,765
The gift of ruling has been summoned!
Our flames have grown bigger.

475
01:00:02,246 --> 01:00:08,845
Now we should hold the fire in our hands.

476
01:00:09,246 --> 01:00:14,005
And grow the fire of battle in our heart bigger!

477
01:00:14,766 --> 01:00:16,765
Now tell me.

478
01:00:16,846 --> 01:00:21,405
Will you march to the whole world with me?

479
01:00:21,526 --> 01:00:23,565
We will, Osman Bey!

480
01:00:23,686 --> 01:00:26,485
Will you fight with me...

481
01:00:26,566 --> 01:00:29,885
...until we drive the
heathens out of our homeland?

482
01:00:29,966 --> 01:00:31,725
We will, Osman Bey

483
01:00:31,806 --> 01:00:34,765
Will you make the world the land of Islam...

484
01:00:35,046 --> 01:00:37,405
...and make the oppressed the ruling?

485
01:00:37,446 --> 01:00:39,125
We will, Osman Bey!

486
01:00:39,206 --> 01:00:44,885
Praise be! Praise be! Thank you.

487
01:00:45,446 --> 01:00:47,805
Thank you.

488
01:00:48,846 --> 01:00:53,085
We won't be the deviants.

489
01:00:54,006 --> 01:00:57,605
We won't be charmed by the gold!

490
01:00:58,086 --> 01:01:02,605
We will never run away..

491
01:01:02,606 --> 01:01:05,485
...in hard times!

492
01:01:05,686 --> 01:01:12,365
We will walk straight to spread
the words of Islam in the world!

493
01:01:12,366 --> 01:01:14,525
We will!

494
01:01:14,766 --> 01:01:18,365
Thank you. Thank you.

495
01:01:20,286 --> 01:01:23,005
Come on then.

496
01:01:23,566 --> 01:01:26,925
Join our tables now.

497
01:01:39,406 --> 01:01:45,085
Well, for the sake of being a Bey...

498
01:01:45,606 --> 01:01:51,685
Beys of Kayi... As the gift, 1000 horses,

499
01:01:51,966 --> 01:01:57,485
...1000 weapons and 1000
goats will be given to you.

500
01:01:57,486 --> 01:01:59,525
-Thank you, my Bey.
-Thank you.

501
01:01:59,606 --> 01:02:03,245
May your hands be strong and your back solid.

502
01:02:03,526 --> 01:02:05,485
-Thank you, my Bey.
-Thank you.

503
01:02:06,046 --> 01:02:09,445
You are going to learn
about the new order tomorrow.

504
01:02:09,766 --> 01:02:12,045
-Boran.
-My Bey!

505
01:02:12,126 --> 01:02:16,725
Play your kopuz and entertain our hearts!

506
01:02:16,966 --> 01:02:18,725
As my Beys orders.

507
01:02:38,006 --> 01:02:42,245
When he reached the age of twenty...

508
01:02:42,606 --> 01:02:46,845
...he received good news in his blessed dream.

509
01:02:47,046 --> 01:02:51,245
Against the tyrants...

510
01:02:51,486 --> 01:02:55,725
...he is the hidden giant, Osman Bey.

511
01:02:55,886 --> 01:03:00,165
He carries the blood of Edebali...

512
01:03:00,566 --> 01:03:04,645
...to bring pain upon the heathens.

513
01:03:05,086 --> 01:03:09,565
He is the pride of Ertugrul Ghazi...

514
01:03:09,806 --> 01:03:15,965
...he is a warrior like no other, Osman Bey.

515
01:03:19,006 --> 01:03:23,125
He made such enemies kneel...

516
01:03:23,206 --> 01:03:29,885
He rode the horses under the open skies...

517
01:03:30,526 --> 01:03:34,885
...and struck down the armies of tyrants.

518
01:03:35,046 --> 01:03:39,645
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.

519
01:03:39,846 --> 01:03:44,125
He struck down the armies of tyrants.

520
01:03:44,206 --> 01:03:48,765
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.

521
01:03:50,246 --> 01:03:54,005
Praise be.

522
01:04:07,086 --> 01:04:11,605
With the grey maned horses...

523
01:04:11,686 --> 01:04:15,965
With good armor and sharp swords...

524
01:04:16,206 --> 01:04:20,365
With warriors and brave hearts...

525
01:04:20,486 --> 01:04:25,245
...he wrote an epic, Osman Bey.

526
01:04:25,566 --> 01:04:29,405
When the gentle people cried out in pain...

527
01:04:29,846 --> 01:04:34,045
He shook the earth with his call...

528
01:04:34,526 --> 01:04:36,605
...to from a state..

529
01:04:36,606 --> 01:04:37,965
...to from a state...

530
01:04:37,966 --> 01:04:39,125
..to from a state...

531
01:04:39,286 --> 01:04:45,325
...and become a home for the innocent.

532
01:04:48,526 --> 01:04:52,925
He made such enemies kneel.

533
01:04:55,686 --> 01:05:00,285
He rode the horses under the open skies...

534
01:05:00,366 --> 01:05:04,925
...and struck down the armies of tyrants.

535
01:05:05,006 --> 01:05:09,285
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.

536
01:05:09,486 --> 01:05:14,205
He struck down the armies of tyrants.

537
01:05:14,286 --> 01:05:18,845
He is a black wolf, Osman Bey.

538
01:05:49,606 --> 01:05:54,045
I thought you were like me, Gonca.

539
01:05:58,886 --> 01:06:01,685
What are you doing, mother?

540
01:06:08,206 --> 01:06:10,645
For daisies, huh?

541
01:06:18,726 --> 01:06:24,365
I gave you a duty and you failed.

542
01:06:24,846 --> 01:06:27,645
What is this but weakness, Gonca?

543
01:06:27,806 --> 01:06:29,965
Mother.

544
01:06:31,606 --> 01:06:36,485
Don't you see what kind of
dead-end you put me into?

545
01:06:37,406 --> 01:06:40,045
What you call a duty...

546
01:06:41,966 --> 01:06:45,085
...is my poison, mother.

547
01:06:47,966 --> 01:06:50,605
Now I pull the strings.

548
01:06:50,726 --> 01:06:55,805
From now on, you won't see Alaaddin.

549
01:06:56,646 --> 01:06:59,645
You will get married in a short time.

550
01:07:00,006 --> 01:07:02,965
What are you talking about, mother?

551
01:07:03,286 --> 01:07:06,405
After your brother marries Holofira,

552
01:07:06,406 --> 01:07:09,485
...you will marry someone that I find.

553
01:07:09,846 --> 01:07:15,325
You'll get married when I find
someone suitable. Until that time

554
01:07:16,166 --> 01:07:19,165
...you will not see Alaaddin.

555
01:07:19,286 --> 01:07:22,165
Mother.

556
01:07:22,486 --> 01:07:23,845
It's over.

557
01:07:40,926 --> 01:07:43,565
You would crush me over..

558
01:07:44,566 --> 01:07:49,725
But not this daisy, mother.

559
01:07:54,846 --> 01:08:00,885
From now on, you will not see Gonca, my son.

560
01:08:00,966 --> 01:08:03,805
What are you saying mother?

561
01:08:04,486 --> 01:08:10,885
-Did you talk with Gonca?
-Gonca does not love you.

562
01:08:12,606 --> 01:08:15,805
-Mother.
-My Alaeddin.

563
01:08:16,006 --> 01:08:18,564
Maybe you were wrong, son?

564
01:08:18,845 --> 01:08:21,885
Maybe your love blinded you.

565
01:08:21,966 --> 01:08:25,725
And you saw your love in her eyes.

566
01:08:28,446 --> 01:08:31,725
Are you saying these?

567
01:08:32,886 --> 01:08:36,404
You told me to weigh with
both my heart and my mind.

568
01:08:36,486 --> 01:08:41,604
I did, mother. My mind and
heart do not believe these words.

569
01:08:41,685 --> 01:08:44,524
You told me to look into
her eyes. Didn't you look?

570
01:08:44,685 --> 01:08:48,805
I did, however..

571
01:08:49,046 --> 01:08:51,765
I did not see it.

572
01:08:51,845 --> 01:08:57,444
I told you I did, mother. I saw
the tear falling from her eye.

573
01:08:57,845 --> 01:09:02,805
I saw the daisies I gave
her in front of me, mother.

574
01:09:02,926 --> 01:09:06,765
Let's say I saw it wrong in
her eyes, what about them?

575
01:09:06,966 --> 01:09:09,885
What were they then, mother?

576
01:09:12,486 --> 01:09:16,725
Alaeddin. From now on..

577
01:09:16,926 --> 01:09:20,325
You will not see Gonca.

578
01:09:21,566 --> 01:09:26,285
Mother. You know something else.

579
01:09:26,765 --> 01:09:30,205
But you're not telling me.

580
01:09:30,805 --> 01:09:33,564
Tell me.

581
01:09:34,086 --> 01:09:37,885
-Mother.
-Ulgen.

582
01:09:38,366 --> 01:09:41,325
Ulgen heard from Germiyanid hatuns.

583
01:09:43,566 --> 01:09:49,325
Gonca loves someone else, my son.

584
01:09:51,006 --> 01:09:55,445
-What?
-You heard it my son.

585
01:09:55,606 --> 01:09:58,405
There is nothing we can do.

586
01:09:58,646 --> 01:10:02,325
Do not get in her way.

587
01:10:14,126 --> 01:10:18,165
No.

588
01:10:18,606 --> 01:10:23,725
No. If you loved someone else..

589
01:10:24,126 --> 01:10:27,685
You wouldn't look at me
like that, Trickster Hatun.

590
01:10:27,846 --> 01:10:30,325
You wouldn't.

591
01:10:36,246 --> 01:10:38,565
The issue of Aysima is closed, my son.

592
01:10:38,686 --> 01:10:41,725
I sent word to his mother
with an appropriate language.

593
01:10:41,726 --> 01:10:45,525
What are you saying mother? Thank Allah.

594
01:10:46,326 --> 01:10:49,205
There is only one issue left.

595
01:10:49,886 --> 01:10:54,725
Mother. This being a muslim thing..

596
01:10:54,926 --> 01:10:58,005
Maybe you should think about it again?

597
01:10:58,086 --> 01:11:04,605
My child. I already made enough concessions.

598
01:11:04,726 --> 01:11:07,885
I only want one condition from you.

599
01:11:08,886 --> 01:11:14,365
-Alright, mother.
-However..

600
01:11:14,446 --> 01:11:16,845
If she accepted Mehmed Bey's offer..

601
01:11:16,926 --> 01:11:21,365
No. Holofira..

602
01:11:21,526 --> 01:11:24,765
Would never do such a thing.

603
01:11:26,286 --> 01:11:30,045
If she does..

604
01:11:34,086 --> 01:11:38,325
-What will you do then?
-You will see if it happens, mother.

605
01:11:38,646 --> 01:11:41,205
My Orhan.

606
01:11:42,446 --> 01:11:47,085
My valiant son. Tomorrow
duties will be handed out.

607
01:11:47,446 --> 01:11:50,725
We are going under a great responsibility.

608
01:11:50,806 --> 01:11:55,405
In a time like this, do not do any mistakes.

609
01:11:55,526 --> 01:12:01,685
My mother, do not worry. I know how to convince.

610
01:12:01,846 --> 01:12:06,165
Holofira will be muslim.

611
01:12:07,206 --> 01:12:11,365
-If you'll excuse me now.
-You may go, my son.

612
01:12:18,566 --> 01:12:25,325
I hope it would be as you said.

613
01:12:28,926 --> 01:12:34,325
While we are making our move
and gaining our independence..

614
01:12:34,646 --> 01:12:38,205
Enemy was not sitting around.

615
01:12:38,326 --> 01:12:43,325
Byzantine is becoming allies with
Mongols to become more powerful.

616
01:12:44,526 --> 01:12:50,165
Emperor's stepdaughter. Princess Maria.

617
01:12:51,406 --> 01:12:58,525
She is wanted to marry with
Amir Gorklu Khan of Ilhanli.

618
01:13:02,166 --> 01:13:06,845
My Bey. Byzantine is in dire, we know them.

619
01:13:06,926 --> 01:13:11,165
Why are the Mongols alright with such a thing?

620
01:13:11,486 --> 01:13:14,365
They started to stop us with governors..

621
01:13:14,686 --> 01:13:17,765
And commanders until now.

622
01:13:17,886 --> 01:13:21,645
-They did not succeed.
-However, they did not succeed.

623
01:13:21,886 --> 01:13:25,125
This is how empires work.

624
01:13:25,566 --> 01:13:30,685
If you do not obey, you are useless.
If you are useless..

625
01:13:30,926 --> 01:13:34,525
You don't have any chance to live.

626
01:13:34,926 --> 01:13:42,925
My Bey. If we do not interfere with this
marriage, they will crush us between mountains.

627
01:13:44,526 --> 01:13:49,885
There were many who stroke
mountains in our bloodline.

628
01:13:51,926 --> 01:13:59,405
We will take Princess Maria. Turks
won't get crushed, but mountains will.

629
01:14:00,246 --> 01:14:05,325
Now, we are waiting for
news from Bayindir and Konur.

630
01:14:05,406 --> 01:14:10,885
If Allah permits, they will tell us
the route of the caravan after sunrise.

631
01:14:12,126 --> 01:14:16,645
Send word to bannerless.
They will come with us tomorrow.

632
01:14:16,966 --> 01:14:20,365
As you command, my bey.

633
01:14:22,526 --> 01:14:28,045
Tomorrow, we will have our independence.
There is no coming back from this now.

634
01:14:32,806 --> 01:14:35,165
Make preparations.

635
01:14:54,086 --> 01:14:57,365
Everyone who will go with the caravan is here.

636
01:14:57,526 --> 01:15:00,365
However, the leader is missing.

637
01:15:00,406 --> 01:15:03,605
The commander who was calling out..

638
01:15:04,726 --> 01:15:10,725
Is there. Their leader should be here soon.

639
01:15:13,926 --> 01:15:16,925
There is a map in front of him that he works on.

640
01:15:17,006 --> 01:15:20,485
Merchant was right, route
is still not decided yet.

641
01:15:20,686 --> 01:15:25,565
Let's see their leader first.
Then we will learn the route.

642
01:15:35,246 --> 01:15:39,365
Master Vasilis.

643
01:15:39,526 --> 01:15:44,125
Devil Veysel. What is this dog doing here?

644
01:15:44,326 --> 01:15:49,045
The commander respects him.
It seems this dog is their leader.

645
01:15:49,286 --> 01:15:51,445
I will have his head myself.

646
01:15:51,526 --> 01:15:53,605
What is the situation, commander?

647
01:15:53,606 --> 01:15:56,285
I've finished the work you wanted for the route.

648
01:15:56,286 --> 01:15:59,645
On the road of Karatas the princess' caravan..

649
01:16:02,286 --> 01:16:05,325
Do you really want to go
from this road, commander?

650
01:16:07,046 --> 01:16:09,565
No.

651
01:16:31,966 --> 01:16:33,885
She will go from this route.

652
01:16:33,966 --> 01:16:38,125
This route is open for
Turks' attacks, Master Vasilis.

653
01:16:38,366 --> 01:16:44,245
Do you think I don't know that? Of course I do.

654
01:16:46,126 --> 01:16:50,565
However, this route is the easiest to defend.

655
01:16:50,646 --> 01:16:55,605
And I already prepared
necessary precations for this.

656
01:16:55,806 --> 01:17:01,045
All this, everything is for
the resurrection of Rome.

657
01:17:02,486 --> 01:17:08,685
Soon, the sun will set from Turks' lands.

658
01:17:10,286 --> 01:17:12,805
Feel it, commander.

659
01:17:16,646 --> 01:17:21,285
The soul of Jesus Christ is with us.

660
01:17:25,966 --> 01:17:31,605
Soldiers. Come with me.

661
01:17:41,806 --> 01:17:46,725
Now, Bayindir Bey.

662
01:17:49,366 --> 01:17:54,845
-What do you think you're doing?
-Soldiers, hurry.

663
01:18:08,886 --> 01:18:12,325
They will use Iznik - Geyve route.

664
01:18:12,486 --> 01:18:14,045
Thank you, Bayindir Bey.

665
01:18:14,166 --> 01:18:16,925
We need to send word to Osman Bey at once.

666
01:18:17,606 --> 01:18:21,045
Come on.

667
01:18:26,526 --> 01:18:29,685
Where am I?

668
01:18:32,886 --> 01:18:38,205
What did I do to you? What did I do to anyone?

669
01:18:39,606 --> 01:18:43,885
Cerkutay. Who saved you?

670
01:18:44,166 --> 01:18:48,125
Who helped you unite
with your son? You will do it.

671
01:18:48,326 --> 01:18:50,085
You will do what I say.

672
01:18:50,166 --> 01:18:53,565
-Shut up, shut up.
-You will be my eyes and ears at palace.

673
01:18:53,646 --> 01:18:56,365
Shut up, shut up!

674
01:18:56,446 --> 01:19:01,245
You were my brother. Did you
become a spy to your own palace?

675
01:19:01,366 --> 01:19:03,645
-How did you do this, Cerkutay? -I did not.

676
01:19:04,366 --> 01:19:07,005
What are you saying, my bey? I didn't do it.

677
01:19:07,286 --> 01:19:10,645
I don't want to hear this! I don't want to!

678
01:19:10,806 --> 01:19:13,245
I do not want to!

679
01:19:16,286 --> 01:19:19,005
-Cerkutay?
-I don't want it.

680
01:19:19,326 --> 01:19:21,165
-I don't want it.
-Cerkutay?

681
01:19:21,166 --> 01:19:24,005
I don't want it.
I don't want it.

682
01:19:24,206 --> 01:19:26,218
What don't you want? Cerkutay?

683
01:19:26,230 --> 01:19:27,405
I don't want it.

684
01:19:28,246 --> 01:19:30,805
Wake up! It's over.

685
01:19:30,886 --> 01:19:33,805
It's over. What don't you want?

686
01:19:33,886 --> 01:19:37,205
-You said I don't want it.
-I died in my dream.

687
01:19:37,286 --> 01:19:41,205
May Allah protect you.

688
01:19:43,366 --> 01:19:46,565
-They offered houri.
-So?

689
01:19:46,646 --> 01:19:49,525
-What did you say? -I said I don't want it.

690
01:19:49,646 --> 01:19:53,285
-You told her that?
-I said I don't want it.

691
01:19:57,766 --> 01:20:01,325
Wake up. Go away.

692
01:20:01,566 --> 01:20:05,685
Get up! Sleep there.

693
01:20:05,766 --> 01:20:09,965
Do you dream about houris? Go away.

694
01:20:11,126 --> 01:20:12,725
You saw houri, is that so?

695
01:20:27,966 --> 01:20:32,925
The enemy has started
showing his teeth already now.

696
01:20:33,166 --> 01:20:37,525
That is why, Uraz Bey

697
01:20:37,606 --> 01:20:41,085
go to Kite with your alps.

698
01:20:41,206 --> 01:20:43,925
-Yes, my Bey.
-You will pay for food expenses

699
01:20:44,086 --> 01:20:47,245
from the place you're going.

700
01:20:47,326 --> 01:20:49,125
Live long, my Bey.

701
01:20:49,246 --> 01:20:51,645
Thank you.

702
01:20:52,086 --> 01:20:55,205
Salur Bey, Demirhan Bey.

703
01:20:55,406 --> 01:20:59,325
Go to Konya area with your alps.

704
01:20:59,526 --> 01:21:01,045
Yes, my Bey.

705
01:21:01,126 --> 01:21:05,205
Your positions will cover your expenses.

706
01:21:08,886 --> 01:21:12,245
-Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

707
01:21:13,246 --> 01:21:16,325
Inhisar is yours.

708
01:21:17,286 --> 01:21:23,565
It will be our outpost against the Mongol raids.

709
01:21:23,966 --> 01:21:29,205
Prepare your alps, I want
Inhisar to be ready in two days.

710
01:21:30,846 --> 01:21:36,645
-My Bey, you saw me fit for it but can I do it?
-Cerkutay.

711
01:21:37,526 --> 01:21:41,125
Since when have you opposed your Bey's words?

712
01:21:49,046 --> 01:21:52,725
Yes, my Bey.

713
01:21:54,806 --> 01:21:58,205
-Orhan Bey.
-My Bey.

714
01:21:59,206 --> 01:22:02,405
-You will go to Kestel.
-Yes, my Bey.

715
01:22:02,646 --> 01:22:05,925
I'll go to Kestel with my
soldiers and I'll hold the borders.

716
01:22:06,086 --> 01:22:09,445
But not to the borders.

717
01:22:09,606 --> 01:22:13,285
You'll go to kestel and sit on the post.

718
01:22:16,966 --> 01:22:21,685
Kestel is our most western land.

719
01:22:21,886 --> 01:22:25,525
It will be our outpost for the conquests.

720
01:22:26,766 --> 01:22:31,845
Kestel is yours from now on.

721
01:22:31,966 --> 01:22:35,685
Kestel is as precious as
my life from now on, my Bey.

722
01:22:35,886 --> 01:22:40,405
Thank you, thank you.

723
01:22:50,086 --> 01:22:54,125
My Bey, we're talking about lands and battles

724
01:22:54,206 --> 01:22:58,205
but what about trade? All the beys
trade in the frontier marketplace.

725
01:22:58,286 --> 01:23:03,005
-How will we make a living?
-You're right.

726
01:23:03,086 --> 01:23:09,285
You're right but do you
think we didn't think about it?

727
01:23:09,406 --> 01:23:13,645
A big marketplace will be set up in Yenisehir.

728
01:23:15,566 --> 01:23:22,765
It will be so big that the frontier
marketplace will look like its child.

729
01:23:25,326 --> 01:23:31,005
Since Kayis are the hosts,
they will not pay any tariffs.

730
01:23:35,126 --> 01:23:39,965
And alps in Yenisehir will secure the

731
01:23:40,446 --> 01:23:44,645
caravans coming from the tribes around.

732
01:23:44,726 --> 01:23:47,445
And Alaeddin Bey

733
01:23:49,206 --> 01:23:56,285
will be leading the alps. From now on,
Alaeddin bey will control the marketplace.

734
01:23:57,646 --> 01:24:00,365
Yes, my Bey.

735
01:24:02,246 --> 01:24:05,005
Thank you.

736
01:24:06,686 --> 01:24:09,965
-May I come in, my Bey?
-Come in.

737
01:24:09,966 --> 01:24:10,365
-May I come in, my Bey? -Come in.

738
01:24:14,966 --> 01:24:17,845
My Bey, we have news.

739
01:24:42,766 --> 01:24:46,085
Konur informs that the Princess has come.

740
01:24:49,406 --> 01:24:53,645
Everybody get back to work.

741
01:25:22,646 --> 01:25:26,685
We'll get there before dark, my Princess.

742
01:25:26,886 --> 01:25:29,405
Very well.

743
01:25:30,806 --> 01:25:34,845
Vasilis, you mentioned about the Turks' attack.

744
01:25:34,926 --> 01:25:38,125
-Have you taken measures about it?
-We have, my Princess.

745
01:25:38,486 --> 01:25:41,605
The great Lords of Byzantium
deployed their soldiers.

746
01:25:41,966 --> 01:25:47,165
If these barbarians try to
attack us, we will punish them.

747
01:26:28,646 --> 01:26:34,085
Emir Coban, not Olcaytu Khan,
is the ruler of the Ilkhanid state.

748
01:26:34,406 --> 01:26:38,565
I want you to serve the Gorklu
Khan way possible to him.

749
01:26:38,726 --> 01:26:43,245
Make a wish to Erlik Khan and let
him take the Princess and come back.

750
01:26:43,446 --> 01:26:47,445
Gorklu Khan will soon come, I don't
want to meet him without having anything.

751
01:26:47,566 --> 01:26:51,325
I'll go and take the Princess and come back

752
01:26:51,406 --> 01:26:54,285
and I leave my job to Tengri and Crusaders.

753
01:27:04,486 --> 01:27:08,005
Come on!

754
01:27:12,646 --> 01:27:16,645
Alps! Surround them.

755
01:27:34,806 --> 01:27:39,285
-Orhan Bey.
-Let's talk, the daughter of the Lord.

756
01:27:51,046 --> 01:27:55,125
What are we going to talk about? I
thought you had nothing else to say.

757
01:27:55,246 --> 01:27:56,949
You didn't know me, after all.

758
01:27:56,961 --> 01:27:58,565
What did you answer Mehmed?

759
01:27:58,686 --> 01:28:02,605
Saadet Hatun refers to
you as my daughter-in-law.

760
01:28:03,166 --> 01:28:05,165
Holofira.

761
01:28:07,086 --> 01:28:12,165
-I don't want to say it, but...
-Orhan.

762
01:28:12,246 --> 01:28:15,525
How could you believe what someone else says?

763
01:28:15,806 --> 01:28:17,405
I haven't answered yet.

764
01:28:17,486 --> 01:28:21,085
Then why Germiyanoglus are around?

765
01:28:21,166 --> 01:28:25,845
-Why do they keep visiting?
I don't know how did it happen.

766
01:28:26,526 --> 01:28:30,525
But there's nothing we can do anymore.

767
01:28:31,646 --> 01:28:36,645
My aunt learned about everything.

768
01:28:36,966 --> 01:28:42,605
-It is up to her now.
-What are you saying, Holofira?

769
01:28:43,366 --> 01:28:46,525
Look at me.

770
01:28:48,606 --> 01:28:52,205
Does your aunt accept it?

771
01:28:52,286 --> 01:28:57,565
Not yet, but Saadet Hatun and Yakup Bey

772
01:28:57,806 --> 01:29:01,925
-may convince her.
-It won't happen.

773
01:29:02,326 --> 01:29:05,925
It won't happen. Holofira

774
01:29:06,206 --> 01:29:10,525
say yes and become a Muslim
and we will get married right away.

775
01:29:10,726 --> 01:29:15,565
Slow down, slow down, Orhan Bey.

776
01:29:18,606 --> 01:29:22,165
I haven't seen you smile in a long time.

777
01:29:22,566 --> 01:29:26,285
However, it suits you very well.

778
01:29:27,646 --> 01:29:32,685
Holofira, I wish you said yes...

779
01:29:33,286 --> 01:29:37,765
...I wish we could arrange our wedding
and others stayed away from us...

780
01:29:38,606 --> 01:29:43,765
I wish you would always
smile and I could watch you.

781
01:29:44,366 --> 01:29:48,645
You have beautiful dreams.

782
01:29:48,726 --> 01:29:54,165
But I said my last word to
you, Orhan. I cannot be Muslim.

783
01:29:57,606 --> 01:30:00,405
What if the conditions were not like this...

784
01:30:00,486 --> 01:30:05,885
...if there were no obstacles,
then would you say yes to me?

785
01:30:07,606 --> 01:30:14,485
Holofira... Do you love me?

786
01:30:19,286 --> 01:30:23,005
Look at my face. Do not turn your eyes away.

787
01:30:25,166 --> 01:30:32,725
Tell me... Do you love me, Holofira?

788
01:30:37,566 --> 01:30:43,565
Love is not enough, Orhan. If my
aunt finds out about this condition...

789
01:30:43,686 --> 01:30:48,525
You do. You love me but...

790
01:30:48,686 --> 01:30:52,965
...you are afraid of your
aunt and my mother. Right?

791
01:30:53,286 --> 01:30:56,685
Orhan... I am talking about something different.

792
01:30:56,766 --> 01:31:00,485
Oghuz Alp! Take soldiers to somewhere safe.

793
01:31:01,246 --> 01:31:05,605
Hatuns will come with us.
-Yes my Shahzade.

794
01:31:10,286 --> 01:31:15,645
Orhan, what are you doing?
-I am abducting you

795
01:31:25,326 --> 01:31:29,205
Any news from your brother?
Did he arrive in Kestel?

796
01:31:29,286 --> 01:31:32,445
He must have, I guess, mother.

797
01:31:33,406 --> 01:31:38,005
What happened? Are you hiding something from me?

798
01:31:44,966 --> 01:31:49,885
Bala mother... My Alaeddin
brother seems lost in thought today.

799
01:31:49,966 --> 01:31:51,536
Did something happen?

800
01:31:51,548 --> 01:31:54,485
You are trying to
change the subject!

801
01:31:57,286 --> 01:32:01,045
He is a little confused.

802
01:32:01,366 --> 01:32:05,525
Go and make him happy, my Fatma.

803
01:32:09,286 --> 01:32:12,285
What happened Bala?
What is wrong?

804
01:32:12,446 --> 01:32:16,365
It is time for Alaeddin to get married, Malhun.

805
01:32:16,966 --> 01:32:20,165
Ulgen.. Hurry.

806
01:32:29,646 --> 01:32:32,405
Look... You are making a mistake, Orhan.

807
01:32:32,566 --> 01:32:36,685
So that you love me, so that
you are afraid of your aunt..

808
01:32:36,846 --> 01:32:41,245
...and scared of my mother, then
we know the solution, Holofira.

809
01:32:41,486 --> 01:32:44,885
The solution is to abduct you.

810
01:32:45,006 --> 01:32:47,765
Come on, Holofira. Come on.

811
01:32:47,846 --> 01:32:52,525
Orhan, look. If my aunt finds out...
-If your aunt finds out...

812
01:32:52,606 --> 01:32:56,445
...she cannot do anything. Come on.

813
01:33:01,726 --> 01:33:03,525
Karaali! -My Shahzade!

814
01:33:03,646 --> 01:33:07,285
To Kestel! -Yes my Shahzade.

815
01:33:07,926 --> 01:33:11,525
We are going to our new home.

816
01:33:41,766 --> 01:33:44,245
Where did this dog come from?

817
01:33:45,126 --> 01:33:51,085
The caravan was supposed to
go to Mongols. But they came.

818
01:34:18,006 --> 01:34:19,965
Commander Karacelasun.

819
01:34:21,006 --> 01:34:25,245
What happened? Couldn't you wait?
We were going to bring the Princess to you.

820
01:34:25,246 --> 01:34:29,605
I can do it on my own, Crusader.

821
01:34:29,686 --> 01:34:32,125
These lands are not safe.

822
01:34:34,086 --> 01:34:39,565
I do not trust your weak soldiers who
cannot even protect their own lands.

823
01:34:40,046 --> 01:34:46,685
If we do not take Princess to Gorklu
Khan, he will take us to death. Come on.

824
01:34:48,086 --> 01:34:52,005
Alright, Mongol. As you say.

825
01:35:12,846 --> 01:35:14,085
Boran! -My Bey!

826
01:35:14,166 --> 01:35:18,245
-We will attack from the top with the archers.
-Yes my Bey.

827
01:35:18,326 --> 01:35:22,285
We will destroy them all when the caravan stops.

828
01:35:22,526 --> 01:35:24,965
Yes my Bey.

829
01:35:27,126 --> 01:35:29,405
Turahan. -My Bey.

830
01:35:29,846 --> 01:35:34,085
The caravan is approaching.
Karacelasun also joined them.

831
01:35:35,406 --> 01:35:42,325
We came here to take the Princess. In this
case, we will also take Karacelasun's head.

832
01:35:42,446 --> 01:35:45,205
Come on, Alps!

833
01:35:47,046 --> 01:35:50,045
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

834
01:35:50,366 --> 01:35:55,085
First, Beylic, now the marketplace, huh?

835
01:35:56,846 --> 01:36:00,165
Osman Bey is not going to stop.

836
01:36:02,706 --> 01:36:05,536
He wants to prevent the trades
in the frontiers marketplace

837
01:36:05,536 --> 01:36:07,636
...by setting up a marketplace in Yenisehir.

838
01:36:07,646 --> 01:36:12,405
So? What are you going to do now, Yakub Sultan?

839
01:36:18,686 --> 01:36:21,245
Kanyumaz! -My Sultan..

840
01:36:21,366 --> 01:36:24,645
Prepare the gifts.

841
01:36:25,566 --> 01:36:28,325
We will go and give our
warm wishes to Osman Bey.

842
01:36:28,406 --> 01:36:32,005
Yes, my Sultan. -Warm wishes?

843
01:36:33,446 --> 01:36:40,445
But we thought you would get angry.

844
01:36:41,966 --> 01:36:47,405
That's what Osman Bey wants. To enrage me.

845
01:36:47,806 --> 01:36:52,845
But... it won't happen.

846
01:36:57,246 --> 01:37:01,685
Beys... these lands...

847
01:37:01,766 --> 01:37:05,565
...need more trades.

848
01:37:06,806 --> 01:37:13,925
Now we will go and say
"Congratulations" to Osman Bey. Come on.

849
01:37:17,806 --> 01:37:21,485
Suleyman Bey!

850
01:37:24,086 --> 01:37:29,405
Were you single?
-Yes, Yakup Bey.

851
01:37:36,166 --> 01:37:41,565
Starting a family is important, Suleyman Bey.

852
01:37:42,926 --> 01:37:46,125
You are late.

853
01:37:49,326 --> 01:37:56,085
You must have started your family
before you sat on the chair of Beylic.

854
01:37:57,886 --> 01:38:02,005
This was my fate, my Yakup Sultan.

855
01:38:02,886 --> 01:38:07,085
Can I come in, my Sultan? -Come in.

856
01:38:10,726 --> 01:38:13,925
My Sultan. We received news from our spies.

857
01:38:14,206 --> 01:38:17,548
Byzantine is sending a
Princess to Mongols to

858
01:38:17,560 --> 01:38:21,205
become allies but Osman
Bey is also aware of that.

859
01:38:25,366 --> 01:38:29,565
I hope Osman does not get us into trouble again.

860
01:38:31,726 --> 01:38:37,125
Come on Beys. We will go
to Osman Bey's marketplace.

861
01:39:19,486 --> 01:39:23,805
Princess, don't be afraid. I'm here.

862
01:39:25,646 --> 01:39:29,125
Horsemen! Ambush! Fight!

863
01:39:30,366 --> 01:39:32,085
Protect the princess!

864
01:39:49,606 --> 01:39:52,245
It's time for you to rise, alps.

865
01:40:03,326 --> 01:40:05,645
This attack will be your death firman!

866
01:40:05,646 --> 01:40:10,805
If it were a real firman, it
would be! But it won't be!

867
01:41:29,646 --> 01:41:32,365
I will kill whoever releases the princess!

868
01:41:49,086 --> 01:41:50,285
Vasilis!

869
01:41:52,406 --> 01:41:57,925
Where are you going? You have a life to give!

870
01:42:00,486 --> 01:42:04,205
Osman, I missed you.

871
01:42:04,366 --> 01:42:07,245
You say so? Come to me.

872
01:42:16,086 --> 01:42:20,005
Come here. Come.

873
01:42:22,086 --> 01:42:27,405
You can't kill us. Souls are immortal, Osman.

874
01:42:27,726 --> 01:42:32,885
I feel sorry for you. You will
never live in peace in these lands.

875
01:42:33,206 --> 01:42:36,565
-Never.
-You say?

876
01:42:38,006 --> 01:42:41,845
You think you can destroy us?

877
01:42:42,206 --> 01:42:46,845
Whenever there is a Pharaoh, we will be Moses.

878
01:42:46,846 --> 01:42:49,885
Whenever there is cruelty,

879
01:42:49,926 --> 01:42:53,885
...we will shield the innocent.

880
01:42:55,206 --> 01:42:59,365
You think you can destroy us?

881
01:43:06,166 --> 01:43:10,245
Get up. Get up

882
01:43:14,446 --> 01:43:17,045
Get up

883
01:43:21,726 --> 01:43:22,565
Up!

884
01:43:42,446 --> 01:43:44,405
We..

885
01:43:45,006 --> 01:43:49,845
Let me meet my God. Come on.

886
01:43:50,086 --> 01:43:54,245
...die one and rise a thousand!

887
01:44:37,046 --> 01:44:39,685
Take the princess!

888
01:44:39,726 --> 01:44:42,485
You can't take the princess before you kill me.

889
01:44:42,486 --> 01:44:45,285
-I will take your head too.
-Take the princess!

890
01:44:45,446 --> 01:44:49,245
Or Gorklu Khan's wrath will rain on us!

891
01:44:54,446 --> 01:44:57,325
It's too late to take the princess.

892
01:44:59,726 --> 01:45:02,405
We are drawing back.

893
01:45:22,006 --> 01:45:25,925
Do you show your dagger to
everyone trying to save you, Princess?

894
01:45:25,926 --> 01:45:30,285
You aren't saving me, Barbarian
Turk! Get your hands off!

895
01:45:31,646 --> 01:45:35,485
Now you've got rid of your
thorns, Princess. Move!

896
01:45:40,966 --> 01:45:43,845
Princess Maria.

897
01:45:44,966 --> 01:45:48,285
They are playing politic games through you.

898
01:45:48,446 --> 01:45:52,645
This is against us. For this reason,

899
01:45:53,046 --> 01:45:55,805
...you will be our guest for a while.

900
01:45:55,886 --> 01:46:00,565
-You can't get away with this.
-Princess.

901
01:46:02,166 --> 01:46:06,405
Aykurt! Take Princess to Sogut.

902
01:46:06,486 --> 01:46:08,845
As you order, my Bey.

903
01:46:09,766 --> 01:46:12,965
The Bannerless will be with you as well.

904
01:46:17,886 --> 01:46:20,045
-Boran.
-My Bey.

905
01:46:20,126 --> 01:46:26,645
We're going to Yenisehir. Those who heard
about the market must have left for Yenisehir.

906
01:46:26,766 --> 01:46:28,365
As you order, my Bey.

907
01:46:28,606 --> 01:46:30,845
Let's go, alps!

908
01:46:43,166 --> 01:46:47,005
I told you to place them orderly! Look at this.

909
01:46:50,166 --> 01:46:55,125
Place them again! How many more times should
I tell you how important this market is?

910
01:46:56,046 --> 01:47:01,925
Calm down. You'll burn the
whole market with your fire, brother.

911
01:47:04,606 --> 01:47:07,165
My heart is burning, sister.

912
01:47:07,486 --> 01:47:10,245
Both my mind and heart are confused.

913
01:47:11,046 --> 01:47:16,565
Brother, Gonca Hatun's tongue tells the truth.

914
01:47:16,966 --> 01:47:21,325
Nobody else's words can't
save you from this trouble.

915
01:47:23,406 --> 01:47:26,685
Gonca is mute to me, Fatma.

916
01:47:28,246 --> 01:47:33,965
Maybe, my mother is right.
Maybe I should stay away from her.

917
01:47:41,006 --> 01:47:47,205
You say so, but my Allah doesn't want so.

918
01:47:51,046 --> 01:47:54,245
This is your destiny, brother. Go talk to her.

919
01:47:54,526 --> 01:47:57,405
I'm too busy, sister.

920
01:48:09,766 --> 01:48:14,405
Look at that. Curious Saadet is here.

921
01:48:16,766 --> 01:48:21,765
-She would never miss this.
-Let's go welcome her.

922
01:48:22,006 --> 01:48:26,965
Ulgen, talk to Gonca.
Alaaddin won't see her again.

923
01:48:27,126 --> 01:48:31,645
It'd be inappropriate for me to talk.
I shouldn't disturb them anymore.

924
01:48:32,646 --> 01:48:38,245
Welcome, Saadet Hatun. I
wasn't expecting to see you.

925
01:48:41,726 --> 01:48:45,005
Why wouldn't I come?

926
01:48:45,446 --> 01:48:50,125
I thought you might need some advice.

927
01:48:51,046 --> 01:48:55,485
You know how skillful I am at the market.

928
01:48:57,886 --> 01:49:00,285
How thoughtful you are.

929
01:49:02,046 --> 01:49:05,685
Let's walk around the market then.

930
01:49:10,366 --> 01:49:15,685
Gonca, we need to talk.

931
01:49:29,366 --> 01:49:34,005
Orhan... Orhan, please listen to me.

932
01:49:34,206 --> 01:49:37,005
This is your room, Lord's daughter. Come on.

933
01:49:37,166 --> 01:49:41,205
Orhan, listen! Please don't do this.

934
01:49:41,206 --> 01:49:44,765
Don't. Send us back before someone hears.

935
01:49:44,806 --> 01:49:49,405
-This won't end up good.
-This will end up good.

936
01:49:49,526 --> 01:49:53,765
It will be very good,
Holofira. I planned everything.

937
01:49:53,886 --> 01:49:57,685
You are putting both of us in danger.
You don't know my aunt.

938
01:49:57,806 --> 01:50:01,925
Your aunt doesn't know
me either, Holofira. Look.

939
01:50:03,486 --> 01:50:07,285
I'm doing everything for us.

940
01:50:07,606 --> 01:50:11,245
For our future. There is no going back.

941
01:50:11,366 --> 01:50:15,285
-Come on.
-How many more times should I tell you?

942
01:50:15,446 --> 01:50:20,205
I won't be a Muslim. We can't get married.

943
01:50:27,206 --> 01:50:31,525
You have everything you need here, Holofira.

944
01:50:31,606 --> 01:50:36,525
If you need anything, alps
will be beside your door.

945
01:50:36,606 --> 01:50:39,125
You can tell them, and
they will do it. Come on now.

946
01:50:39,246 --> 01:50:41,325
Orhan, listen to me.

947
01:50:41,446 --> 01:50:46,645
Orhan listen to me for once. Don't do this.

948
01:50:56,086 --> 01:51:02,165
I know how to warm your heart towards Islam.

949
01:51:02,966 --> 01:51:08,965
You are a good person, Gonca Hatun. You
did what I said and ruined your trickery.

950
01:51:09,326 --> 01:51:12,365
You don't know anything Ulgen.

951
01:51:13,486 --> 01:51:17,845
Do you think I did that
trickery because I wanted?

952
01:51:18,046 --> 01:51:22,885
I am the last person to wish harm to Alaeddin.

953
01:51:25,006 --> 01:51:27,485
Look here.

954
01:51:28,526 --> 01:51:34,605
Do you.. Do you really
love Alaeddin Bey for real?

955
01:51:37,126 --> 01:51:40,445
The heart wants what it wants.

956
01:51:42,646 --> 01:51:45,645
You love him.

957
01:51:47,006 --> 01:51:50,725
I know it is impossible. I know it won't work.

958
01:51:51,006 --> 01:51:53,845
Gonca. I did something.

959
01:51:55,886 --> 01:51:59,285
I did such a thing. But I had to.

960
01:51:59,446 --> 01:52:02,885
When Bala Hatun told me to speak..

961
01:52:03,046 --> 01:52:06,165
Did you tell that to Alaeddin?

962
01:52:08,806 --> 01:52:11,365
I said Gonca Hatun loves someone else.

963
01:52:11,446 --> 01:52:14,525
Ulgen what did you do?

964
01:52:14,646 --> 01:52:20,125
I don't know. I couldn't have said the truth.

965
01:52:20,366 --> 01:52:23,205
That was the first thing that came to my mind.

966
01:52:24,046 --> 01:52:27,165
Bala Hatun, did she tell that to Alaeddin?

967
01:52:27,246 --> 01:52:30,005
No. I mean, I don't know.

968
01:52:30,886 --> 01:52:33,845
However, even if she didn't, she will tell soon.

969
01:52:34,766 --> 01:52:37,805
She looked at me angrily.

970
01:52:40,126 --> 01:52:43,765
I need to tell him before Bala Hatun does.

971
01:52:43,926 --> 01:52:48,485
Gonca. Will you really tell everything?

972
01:52:48,686 --> 01:52:53,005
I did the mistake. Let
him learn all of it from me.

973
01:52:54,406 --> 01:52:58,845
-Can you call Alaeddin to there?
-Yes.

974
01:52:59,086 --> 01:53:04,725
-Do not worry, I will tell him now.
-Alright, come on.

975
01:53:12,326 --> 01:53:15,845
So you caused all this Ulgen.

976
01:53:16,286 --> 01:53:20,885
When Saadet Hatun hears
this she will show you what it is.

977
01:53:48,406 --> 01:53:54,205
Praise be! Praise be! It is alright, even
not as much as frontier marketplace.

978
01:53:54,406 --> 01:53:57,205
As always, I will buy the first stall.

979
01:53:57,206 --> 01:54:00,845
It seems frontier marketplace is
not enough for you, Saadet Hatun.

980
01:54:00,846 --> 01:54:04,125
Trade needs competition, Bala Hatun.

981
01:54:04,326 --> 01:54:12,885
Yenisehir Marketplace is good. This way
frontier marketplace will be more valuable.

982
01:54:14,246 --> 01:54:20,525
Since you want to buy the first stall,
pick any place you want, Saadet Hatun.

983
01:54:20,606 --> 01:54:25,125
Even though you gave us the most silent corner.

984
01:54:25,326 --> 01:54:30,125
Do you think your rugs and
my goods are the same, Malhun?

985
01:54:30,286 --> 01:54:33,525
Of course, the most
magnificent stall will be mine.

986
01:54:34,166 --> 01:54:36,525
You're also right, Saadet Hatun.

987
01:54:36,606 --> 01:54:40,085
The trade going on in
Yenisehir is not like any other.

988
01:54:40,206 --> 01:54:44,925
Thanks to us, you attract buyers
to frontier marketplace, right?

989
01:54:50,766 --> 01:54:54,445
Now, if you'll excuse me hatuns.

990
01:54:54,526 --> 01:54:57,325
I will go around the marketplace.

991
01:54:57,406 --> 01:54:59,725
Let me see where..

992
01:54:59,926 --> 01:55:03,445
The most magnificent stall is.
-Go, have a look.

993
01:55:40,086 --> 01:55:43,885
Amir Gorklu Khan.

994
01:55:58,966 --> 01:56:03,285
You couldn't get revenge from Osman..

995
01:56:03,886 --> 01:56:09,085
Now you let them took the Princess.

996
01:56:09,246 --> 01:56:13,285
Until my soul leaves my body..

997
01:56:13,366 --> 01:56:15,965
I will have Osman's head!

998
01:56:16,046 --> 01:56:18,965
You ran away from Osman.

999
01:56:19,126 --> 01:56:23,165
You left the Princess.

1000
01:56:23,446 --> 01:56:26,565
You seeing eyes..

1001
01:56:26,686 --> 01:56:31,045
Will not see anymore.
You souls..

1002
01:56:31,246 --> 01:56:36,485
Will reach to Tamu(hell)!

1003
01:56:37,046 --> 01:56:40,805
My enemy becomes the earth itself.

1004
01:56:40,926 --> 01:56:44,325
Their blood spills, becomes a river!

1005
01:57:05,166 --> 01:57:08,485
The death of my nokers..

1006
01:57:08,686 --> 01:57:14,125
Becomes a legend!

1007
01:57:15,046 --> 01:57:18,365
The brave lives on!

1008
01:57:20,366 --> 01:57:23,565
Gorklu Khan I will get her.

1009
01:57:23,726 --> 01:57:26,325
I will get Osman and the Princess!

1010
01:57:26,646 --> 01:57:34,565
You are as incapable as not
even getting your own revenge.

1011
01:57:34,886 --> 01:57:39,685
You put the might of IIhanli
under the boots of Osman.

1012
01:57:39,766 --> 01:57:44,885
Amir Gorklu Khan. Osman's
alps are taking Princess to Sogut.

1013
01:57:48,606 --> 01:57:52,925
Gorklu Khan. Sogut is the first city of Kayi.

1014
01:57:53,006 --> 01:57:58,365
Allow me to get the Princess
and my revenge from Osman!

1015
01:57:58,486 --> 01:58:02,845
Osman is my enemy now!

1016
01:58:02,926 --> 01:58:07,325
His head is mine!

1017
01:58:07,606 --> 01:58:13,605
However, he must not reach the
other world without getting revenge.

1018
01:58:14,446 --> 01:58:19,885
You will have your revenge for your services.

1019
01:58:20,446 --> 01:58:21,845
Get up.

1020
01:58:27,766 --> 01:58:30,125
They had me unsheathe my sword.

1021
01:58:30,406 --> 01:58:33,285
Now the cold will be washed with blood!

1022
01:58:33,366 --> 01:58:36,805
We will have the heads of those who rebel!

1023
01:58:36,886 --> 01:58:50,285
Strong Amir! Strong Amir!

1024
01:59:11,646 --> 01:59:13,165
I will tell him.

1025
01:59:15,206 --> 01:59:20,525
He might think I am a bad
person. He will learn everything.

1026
01:59:25,766 --> 01:59:28,165
Trickster Hatun.

1027
01:59:33,566 --> 01:59:36,045
Alaeddin Bey.

1028
01:59:36,926 --> 01:59:42,045
Last time you rejected me. Now
you sent me a note to invite me.

1029
01:59:43,286 --> 01:59:48,165
Why? Did taking a few steps tire you?

1030
01:59:50,606 --> 01:59:53,325
I used to come everytime you invited me.

1031
01:59:55,206 --> 01:59:57,845
And I never said I was tired.

1032
01:59:58,126 --> 02:00:00,405
-And with one time..
-No.

1033
02:00:00,726 --> 02:00:05,805
Even if you invited me behind
the Mount Qaf, I would still come.

1034
02:00:06,646 --> 02:00:10,685
You would, but why do you look
at me that way, Alaeddin Bey?

1035
02:00:13,406 --> 02:00:17,085
I heard something.

1036
02:00:18,006 --> 02:00:22,085
I am trying to get my answer from your eyes.

1037
02:00:25,126 --> 02:00:27,205
Gonca...

1038
02:00:28,126 --> 02:00:33,845
-They told me you love someone e...
-No.

1039
02:00:38,246 --> 02:00:42,085
They were wrong.

1040
02:00:47,326 --> 02:00:50,085
I don't love anyone.

1041
02:00:53,246 --> 02:00:55,845
Anyone, huh?

1042
02:00:57,686 --> 02:01:00,365
If there is no one... Do you also not love me...

1043
02:01:00,446 --> 02:01:02,245
Alaeddin Bey.. -No.

1044
02:01:02,326 --> 02:01:04,005
Call me Scholar.

1045
02:01:05,286 --> 02:01:08,725
I didn't like "Alaeddin Bey".

1046
02:01:10,446 --> 02:01:13,085
Good.

1047
02:01:20,046 --> 02:01:22,245
Scholar...

1048
02:01:25,086 --> 02:01:27,005
I want to talk to you.

1049
02:01:27,126 --> 02:01:29,965
Talk, Trickster Hatun. Talk to me.

1050
02:01:30,206 --> 02:01:33,685
But... answer my question first.

1051
02:01:36,166 --> 02:01:41,365
So that there is no one else,
then why did you reject me?

1052
02:01:43,046 --> 02:01:45,005
Now we are talking about...

1053
02:01:45,086 --> 02:01:49,845
First look into my eyes and
answer my question, Coy Hatun.

1054
02:01:54,086 --> 02:02:00,125
What changed in one day and you gave
me an answer which was similar to a poison?

1055
02:02:03,166 --> 02:02:07,085
Gonca... Look at my eyes.

1056
02:02:10,206 --> 02:02:15,405
I don't need another answer when
you are looking at me like that but...

1057
02:02:15,846 --> 02:02:17,485
Alaeddin Bey...

1058
02:02:20,446 --> 02:02:23,205
Do not expect that answer from me.

1059
02:02:24,726 --> 02:02:28,365
I have different answers to give you.

1060
02:02:32,926 --> 02:02:36,205
Alaeddin...

1061
02:02:37,926 --> 02:02:42,925
I... listened to my mother and...
-Gonca.

1062
02:02:43,446 --> 02:02:45,445
Mother!

1063
02:02:48,806 --> 02:02:52,205
Saadet Hatun...

1064
02:03:03,686 --> 02:03:10,005
Didn't I tell you not to talk to Alaeddin again?

1065
02:03:15,446 --> 02:03:19,085
Saadet Hatun...

1066
02:03:20,006 --> 02:03:24,045
Pull yourself together! The one
standing in front of you is your daughter!

1067
02:03:24,046 --> 02:03:27,725
Alaeddin Bey! Don't you..

1068
02:03:28,046 --> 02:03:32,485
...approach my daughter again!

1069
02:03:50,726 --> 02:03:54,365
My Allah, give me patience.

1070
02:03:55,046 --> 02:03:58,445
Osman Bey is coming!

1071
02:04:13,926 --> 02:04:16,685
For Gorklu Khan..

1072
02:04:33,966 --> 02:04:38,845
What is happening there?
Move! What is happening?

1073
02:04:39,326 --> 02:04:42,605
Brother... Mongol soldier...

1074
02:04:42,966 --> 02:04:47,285
There is a spy! Alps! Take our people inside!

1075
02:05:03,646 --> 02:05:07,205
The end of the jackal who gets
in the cave of wolves is death!

1076
02:05:07,246 --> 02:05:09,845
Protect our people! Come on! Inside!

1077
02:05:09,846 --> 02:05:17,925
The darkness brought death to
Sogut! Whoever stands before him dies!

1078
02:05:37,046 --> 02:05:43,525
Alps! Go to Yenisehir! Inform Osman Bey! Go!

1079
02:06:10,126 --> 02:06:14,125
You will be burnt alive!

1080
02:06:34,686 --> 02:06:37,765
Take the Princess! Burn the rest of them...

1081
02:06:37,766 --> 02:06:42,525
...to teach everyone a lesson!

1082
02:06:46,126 --> 02:06:48,125
Peace be upon you. May it be easy.

1083
02:06:48,206 --> 02:06:50,005
-Peace be upon you too.
- May you earn well.

1084
02:06:50,006 --> 02:06:52,045
Thank you, my Bey. Welcome.

1085
02:06:53,166 --> 02:06:57,885
So... Tell me, how much is this?

1086
02:06:58,246 --> 02:07:01,565
My Bey, we are making these
shoes with the black goatskin.

1087
02:07:01,646 --> 02:07:05,645
Every part of it is fine workmanship.
We sell it for three coins.

1088
02:07:05,726 --> 02:07:08,965
Three coins? -Yes my Bey.

1089
02:07:15,246 --> 02:07:18,205
Isn't this too cheap?

1090
02:07:18,206 --> 02:07:21,405
My Bey... You opened a source
of income for us in the marketplace.

1091
02:07:21,446 --> 02:07:23,645
And we sell at a lower profit.

1092
02:07:23,806 --> 02:07:27,002
Our Alaeddin Bey also
set measures. It is forbidden

1093
02:07:27,014 --> 02:07:29,605
for us to sell it for
higher than 5 coins.

1094
02:07:31,766 --> 02:07:34,405
Good, good.

1095
02:07:34,686 --> 02:07:38,445
May it be easy. -Thank you. May Allah bless you.

1096
02:07:39,526 --> 02:07:42,885
My son... Did you set limits for everything?

1097
02:07:42,966 --> 02:07:48,245
I did, my Bey. In this way, we are
providing equality and preventing cheating.

1098
02:07:48,326 --> 02:07:52,125
Thank you. The state is a whole.

1099
02:07:52,206 --> 02:07:58,205
If the merchant's balance is not off, not
even a stone will touch the Alp's feet in war.

1100
02:08:00,126 --> 02:08:03,285
Thank you. You did the right thing.

1101
02:08:03,366 --> 02:08:06,365
Thank you my Bey. I appreciate it.

1102
02:08:07,486 --> 02:08:10,485
Let's go to this counter. Malhun..

1103
02:08:10,766 --> 02:08:12,085
Check these..

1104
02:08:12,166 --> 02:08:15,525
-Welcome.
-Thank you, may it be easy.

1105
02:08:15,606 --> 02:08:19,845
It's all hand woven. They are very
beautiful. Thanks to your hands.

1106
02:08:28,566 --> 02:08:31,885
Osman Bey!

1107
02:08:47,246 --> 02:08:52,125
We invited you to the opening
of the frontiers marketplace.

1108
02:08:52,846 --> 02:08:56,245
Why didn't you invite us?

1109
02:08:56,366 --> 02:09:02,245
What happened, Yakup Bey?
The marketplace is still new.

1110
02:09:03,206 --> 02:09:08,765
If it was the right time
to invite you, we would.

1111
02:09:11,686 --> 02:09:14,125
What happened? Why did you come here?

1112
02:09:14,406 --> 02:09:20,325
You are declaring a sovereign Beylic
on the lands where there is a Sultan.

1113
02:09:21,486 --> 02:09:26,125
Isn't it normal for me to come
here and stand before you?

1114
02:09:33,526 --> 02:09:37,845
When were we afraid of
those who stood before us?

1115
02:09:40,206 --> 02:09:45,685
Tell me... What brought you here?

1116
02:09:47,486 --> 02:09:51,565
The reason why I came here..
-Yes?

1117
02:10:36,286 --> 02:10:39,565
They are going to the dungeon!

1118
02:10:39,926 --> 02:10:46,645
They can! The dungeon will be their grave!

1119
02:10:53,246 --> 02:10:56,005
Where are you going, Mongol dogs?

1120
02:10:56,086 --> 02:11:00,285
I kill those who dare to take what is mine!

1121
02:11:00,366 --> 02:11:03,925
Attack until Sogut is burnt down!

1122
02:11:04,206 --> 02:11:08,285
Sogut will be safe, and you will be destroyed!

1123
02:11:08,486 --> 02:11:12,525
Your brave words will
make your death come faster!

1124
02:11:12,806 --> 02:11:16,845
-You pathetic dastard!
-Hit, bannerless, hit!

1125
02:11:16,966 --> 02:11:19,725
Ruin the oppressors!

1126
02:11:19,806 --> 02:11:22,725
Our same and our da'wah is the same!

1127
02:11:22,806 --> 02:11:26,965
Hit bannerless, hit!

1128
02:12:02,886 --> 02:12:06,205
Brother!

1129
02:12:24,406 --> 02:12:28,525
Come on, let's go to the
dungeon to save the Princess.

1130
02:12:33,486 --> 02:12:39,085
One shall be in sorrow, pursuing a cure,

1131
02:12:40,286 --> 02:12:46,205
Is he in love if he does
not seek a way to endure?

1132
02:12:47,446 --> 02:12:54,165
O' Yunus, embrace the pain of your friend,

1133
02:12:55,126 --> 02:13:00,125
Is he in love if no arrow
of love in him is penned?

1134
02:13:16,766 --> 02:13:20,865
-Peace be upon you, Yunus Emre
-Peace be upon you too.

1135
02:13:21,046 --> 02:13:24,605
You've brought joy, Orhan Bey.

1136
02:13:32,806 --> 02:13:36,125
I hope it is not a wrong time.

1137
02:13:38,366 --> 02:13:41,245
There is a very important issue.

1138
02:13:41,966 --> 02:13:46,485
-I ask for your help, Yunus Emre.
-Astagfirullah.

1139
02:13:47,126 --> 02:13:50,805
If I have a cure, I will
give it to you for sure.

1140
02:13:51,046 --> 02:13:54,245
-Thank you.
-Here.

1141
02:13:54,686 --> 02:13:57,285
Have a seat.

1142
02:14:07,526 --> 02:14:14,765
My mother will only agree to our
marriage if Holofira becomes a Muslim.

1143
02:14:16,286 --> 02:14:22,485
And I want her to be a Muslim so
we can be together in both worlds.

1144
02:14:23,286 --> 02:14:29,285
But I can't convince Holofira.

1145
02:14:30,606 --> 02:14:38,965
Yunus Emre, I want you
to make Holofira love Islam.

1146
02:14:41,566 --> 02:14:47,525
There is only One Maker, Orhan Bey.

1147
02:14:48,006 --> 02:14:51,085
There is only One Who can make someone love.

1148
02:14:51,366 --> 02:14:55,365
A person does not believe
when we want her to believe.

1149
02:14:55,526 --> 02:15:01,285
-It happens when she wants it.
-She doesn't want it.

1150
02:15:02,486 --> 02:15:06,525
I don't know what to do, Yunus Emre.

1151
02:15:07,286 --> 02:15:10,885
Your words are so effective.

1152
02:15:11,166 --> 02:15:16,725
When we first met, even Holofira

1153
02:15:16,846 --> 02:15:21,205
was fascinated by your words.

1154
02:15:21,566 --> 02:15:30,125
So what I mean is that you have
the cure for my problem, Yunus Emre.

1155
02:15:31,046 --> 02:15:34,535
-The Messenger of Allah...
-Peace be upon him.

1156
02:15:34,646 --> 02:15:39,445
...tried to talk his uncle Ebu Talib...

1157
02:15:39,566 --> 02:15:41,845
...into believing.

1158
02:15:42,846 --> 02:15:47,645
You know, his uncle...

1159
02:15:48,006 --> 02:15:51,965
...even after all those persistence...

1160
02:15:53,686 --> 02:15:58,125
...chose to believe his ancestors' religion.

1161
02:15:59,046 --> 02:16:02,965
And love...

1162
02:16:03,166 --> 02:16:06,285
His uncle was as precious as his own life

1163
02:16:06,366 --> 02:16:09,285
for our Prophet (PBUH).

1164
02:16:09,926 --> 02:16:13,925
That's why, he said that

1165
02:16:14,046 --> 02:16:18,205
he'll keep making requests for
him as long is it is not forbidden.

1166
02:16:18,526 --> 02:16:22,445
And Allah sent a verse upon this,

1167
02:16:22,526 --> 02:16:25,285
and said

1168
02:16:25,966 --> 02:16:31,485
"You surely cannot guide whoever you like,

1169
02:16:32,924 --> 02:16:37,084
but it is Allah Who guides whoever He wills

1170
02:16:37,606 --> 02:16:42,725
and He knows best who are fit to be guided."

1171
02:16:43,366 --> 02:16:46,525
While there were so many people...

1172
02:16:46,606 --> 02:16:49,525
...that did not believe in The
Messenger of Allah's (PBUH) words...

1173
02:16:50,325 --> 02:16:54,445
...what effect can our words have?

1174
02:16:54,846 --> 02:17:00,763
Surely He owns all the hearts.

1175
02:17:02,084 --> 02:17:05,084
So you're saying, Yunus Emre

1176
02:17:05,526 --> 02:17:09,525
that "just sit and wait," is that so?

1177
02:17:09,606 --> 02:17:13,885
No. A Muslim does not wait.

1178
02:17:14,084 --> 02:17:16,924
He always makes an effort.

1179
02:17:17,004 --> 02:17:23,045
But you want us to talk to her about Islam,

1180
02:17:23,165 --> 02:17:26,924
let's talk about it with the
language of state, not words.

1181
02:17:27,886 --> 02:17:31,763
Let us tell it like how our Prophet (PBUH) did.

1182
02:17:31,846 --> 02:17:35,525
Otherwise, it is easy to

1183
02:17:35,726 --> 02:17:40,125
sit and talk about heaven and hell.

1184
02:17:41,126 --> 02:17:46,125
It is easy to talk about Islam.

1185
02:17:46,526 --> 02:17:51,445
The important thing is to become a Muslim.

1186
02:17:53,126 --> 02:17:55,965
Can we become one?

1187
02:17:58,566 --> 02:18:01,965
Can we have the manners that our Prophet had?

1188
02:18:04,245 --> 02:18:09,525
Is our sincerity in worship his sincerity?

1189
02:18:10,046 --> 02:18:16,843
That's why we will look at these
things first, we will talk about it later.

1190
02:18:18,606 --> 02:18:22,645
First, Holofira will see a Muslim

1191
02:18:22,966 --> 02:18:25,885
and she will want to know about Islam.

1192
02:18:25,966 --> 02:18:32,645
She will want to listen so that she can hear.

1193
02:18:34,046 --> 02:18:38,245
If not, everything we say

1194
02:18:38,406 --> 02:18:41,125
will be nonsense for her.

1195
02:18:45,325 --> 02:18:50,565
It's up to you to make Holofira want it.

1196
02:18:52,046 --> 02:18:55,885
It's up to me

1197
02:18:56,566 --> 02:18:59,445
to make Holofira want it.

1198
02:19:00,726 --> 02:19:04,084
Thank you, Yunus Emre.

1199
02:19:10,366 --> 02:19:13,045
I'm here to

1200
02:19:13,165 --> 02:19:15,565
congratulate you

1201
02:19:15,806 --> 02:19:21,045
about your sovereign Beylic
and marketplace, Osman Bey.

1202
02:19:24,726 --> 02:19:27,565
Bring the gifts.

1203
02:19:32,726 --> 02:19:36,125
Osman Bey.

1204
02:20:17,126 --> 02:20:20,125
Thank you.

1205
02:20:36,766 --> 02:20:40,045
Thank you, Yakup Bey.

1206
02:20:42,686 --> 02:20:47,325
The fact that you're not my Bey anymore

1207
02:20:48,166 --> 02:20:52,645
does not make us enemies, Osman Bey.

1208
02:20:57,686 --> 02:21:04,205
We want our people to exist.

1209
02:21:04,486 --> 02:21:08,525
We want the same thing for you, Osman Bey.

1210
02:21:08,646 --> 02:21:12,005
Thank you.

1211
02:21:28,246 --> 02:21:33,405
My Bey, Mongols attacked
Sogut to take the Princess.

1212
02:21:33,526 --> 02:21:35,885
What?

1213
02:21:44,206 --> 02:21:46,805
Princess.

1214
02:21:50,246 --> 02:21:52,965
What happened, Osman Bey?

1215
02:21:53,206 --> 02:21:56,285
It's not well, Yakup Bey.

1216
02:21:58,406 --> 02:22:01,125
Mongol dogs raided Sogut.

1217
02:22:05,566 --> 02:22:10,165
Now they will be treated with our furor.

1218
02:22:13,206 --> 02:22:14,365
Alps!

1219
02:22:16,246 --> 02:22:17,245
Come on.

1220
02:22:22,688 --> 02:22:35,048
Visit turkision.com for more!